window.MORE=window.MORE||{};window.MORE.permit={"2":[["p8",2,["booster seat","chèz booster"],["Jiska ki laj oswa wotè yon timoun dwe chita nan yon chèz machin oswa yon booster?","5 an","6 an oswa 50 pous wotè","8 an oswa 57 pous wotè","12 an","Timoun yo dwe sèvi ak yon chèz timoun oswa yon booster apwouve jiskaske yo gen omwen 8 an oswa omwen 57 pous wotè."],["Until when must a child ride in a car seat or booster seat?","Age 5","Age 6 or 50 inches tall","Age 8 or 57 inches tall","Age 12","Children must use a federally approved child seat or booster until they are at least 8 years old or at least 57 inches tall."]],["pm202",0,["air bag","airbag"],["Ki kote li pa janm san danje pou w mete yon chèz bebe ki gade dèyè?","Sou yon chèz devan ki gen airbag","Nan mitan chèz dèyè a","Dèyè chofè a","Dèyè pasaje devan an","Yon airbag ki louvri sou yon chèz ki gade dèyè ka blese bebe a grav. Timoun yo pi an sekirite nan chèz dèyè, pi bon nan mitan."],["Where is it never safe to put a rear-facing infant seat?","In a front seat with an air bag","In the back middle seat","Behind the driver","Behind the front passenger","An air bag opening against a rear-facing seat can seriously hurt the baby. Children are safest in the back seat, best in the middle."]],["pm203",1,["lap belt","senti ren"],["Kijan senti ki sou ren an dwe chita sou ou?","Sou vant ou, lach","Ba, sere epi plat sou anch yo","Tòde, pou l kenbe pi byen","Anba bra w","Senti ren an dwe ba, sere epi plat sou anch yo, san l pa tòde. Senti zepòl la travèse zepòl ak pwatrin, pa janm anba bra a ni sou kou a."],["How should a lap belt fit?","Across the stomach, loose","Low, tight and flat across the hips","Twisted, so it holds better","Under your arm","A lap belt goes low, tight and flat over the hips, not twisted. A shoulder belt crosses the shoulder and chest, never under the arm or across the neck."]],["p2",3,["hands-free","san men"],["Èske yon chofè ki poko gen 18 an ka sèvi ak telefòn pandan l ap kondui si se san men (hands-free)?","Wi, pou apèl sèlman, toutotan de men yo rete sou volan an","Wi, pou GPS sèlman","Wi, nan limyè wouj","Non, pou okenn rezon sof pou rapòte yon ijans","Chofè ki poko gen 18 an pa ka sèvi ak okenn aparèy elektwonik pandan y ap kondui, menm san men. Sèl eksepsyon se pou rapòte yon ijans."],["Can a driver under 18 use a phone while driving if it is hands-free?","Yes, for phone calls only, as long as both hands stay on the wheel","Yes, for GPS directions only","Yes, at red lights","No, not for any reason except reporting an emergency","Drivers under 18 may not use any mobile electronic device while driving, even hands-free. The only exception is reporting an emergency."]],["p10",1,["mounted phone","telefòn ki tache"],["Pou chofè ki gen 18 an oswa plis, kijan yo ka sèvi ak telefòn pandan y ap kondui?","Voye tèks nan limyè wouj","Sèlman san men, tankou kòmand vwa","Kenbe telefòn nan sou opalè","Gade videyo si sikilasyon an lan","Massachusetts entèdi kenbe telefòn pandan w ap kondui. Granmoun ka sèvi ak telefòn nan sèlman san men: li dwe tache, epi ou ka touche l sèlman pou limen mòd san men an."],["For drivers 18 and older, which phone use is allowed while driving?","Texting at red lights","Hands-free use only, such as voice commands","Holding the phone on speaker","Watching a video in slow traffic","Massachusetts bans holding a phone while driving. Adults may use a phone only in hands-free mode: it must be mounted, and touched only to turn on hands-free mode."]],["pm204",2,["travel lane","vwa sikilasyon"],["Ou gen 25 an. Kilè ou ka kenbe telefòn ou nan men pou w li yon mesaj?","Lè w kanpe nan yon limyè wouj oswa yon siy stop","Lè w rale sou bòdi yon gran wout ki gen anpil trafik","Lè machin nan kanpe epi li pa nan vwa sikilasyon, nan yon kote ki san danje","Lè sikilasyon an ap mache dousman","Ou ka kenbe aparèy la sèlman lè machin nan kanpe epi li pa nan yon vwa sikilasyon piblik, pa janm nan limyè wouj ni nan siy STOP. Pa kanpe sou bò yon wout ki gen anpil machin pou w sèvi ak telefòn."],["You are 25. When may you hold your phone in your hand to read a message?","While stopped at a red light or a stop sign","When pulled onto the shoulder of a busy highway","When the car is stopped and out of a travel lane, in a safe place","In slow traffic","Handheld use is allowed only when the vehicle is stopped and not in a public travel lane, never at red lights or stop signs. Do not stop on the side of a busy road to use a phone."]],["pm205",0,["headphones","kas pou tande"],["Kisa ki vre sou kas pou tande pandan w ap kondui?","Yo entèdi; chofè 18 an oswa plis ka mete yon sèl ti bouchon pou telefòn","Yo pèmèt nan de zòrèy si volim nan ba","Yo otorize sou otowout sèlman","Kas san fil toujou pèmèt pou chofè ki gen 18 an oswa plis","Kas oswa nenpòt aparèy ki anpeche w tande sa k ap pase bò kote w entèdi pandan w ap kondui. Chofè 18 an oswa plis ka mete yon sèl ti bouchon pou telefòn."],["Which is true about headphones while driving?","They are illegal; drivers 18 and older may use one earplug for a phone","They are allowed in both ears if the volume is low","They are allowed only on highways","Wireless headphones are always allowed for drivers 18 and older","Headphones or any device that cuts you off from the sounds around you are illegal while driving. Drivers 18 and older may use one earplug for a cell phone."]],["pm206",1,["fine","amann"],["Konbyen amann lan ye pou premye fwa yo kenbe w ap kenbe telefòn pandan w ap kondui?","$25","$100","$250","$500","$100 premye fwa, $250 plis yon klas sou distraksyon dezyèm fwa, $500 plis yon klas ak yon ogmantasyon asirans apre sa."],["What is the fine for a first offense of holding a phone while driving?","$25","$100","$250","$500","$100 for a first offense, $250 plus a distracted-driving class for a second, $500 plus a class and an insurance surcharge after that."]],["pm207",0,["right-of-way","dwa de pasaj"],["Kondui ak prekosyon gen ladan ki lide?","Dwa de pasaj se yon bagay ou bay, pou evite sitiyasyon ki danjere","Lòt chofè yo ap toujou respekte siyal yo","Gade sèlman machin ki devan w lan","Pran dwa de pasaj chak fwa lalwa ba ou l","Atann ou pou lòt moun fè erè epi kenbe espas toutotou machin ou. Mànyèl la raple w dwa de pasaj se yon bagay ou bay."],["Driving defensively includes which idea?","Right-of-way is something you give, to prevent unsafe situations","Other drivers will always obey signals","Watch only the car in front of you","Take the right-of-way whenever the law gives it to you","Expect mistakes from others and keep space around your car. The manual reminds you that right-of-way is something you give."]],["pm208",2,["tread","tredd kawoutchou"],["Ki pwofondè tredd minimòm lalwa mande pou kawoutchou yo?","1/32 pous","4/32 pous","2/32 pous","1/2 pous","Kawoutchou yo bezwen omwen 2/32 pous tredd. Si w mete yon penny nan tredd la epi w wè tèt Lincoln nèt, kawoutchou yo fin itilize."],["What is the minimum legal tire tread depth?","1/32 inch","4/32 inch","2/32 inch","1/2 inch","Tires need at least 2/32 inch of tread. If you put a penny in the groove and see the top of Lincoln's head, the tires are worn out."]],["pm209",3,["three-second rule","règ twa segonn"],["Lè kondisyon yo bon, ki distans minimòm pou w kenbe dèyè yon machin?","Longè yon machin","Yon segonn","Dis segonn","Twa segonn","Sèvi ak règ twa segonn lan: lè machin devan an pase yon bagay ki pa bouje, konte twa segonn anvan w rive la. Se yon minimòm; ajoute tan lè kondisyon yo pa bon."],["In good conditions, what is the minimum following distance behind a car?","One car length","One second","Ten seconds","Three seconds","Use the three-second rule: when the car ahead passes a fixed object, count three seconds before you reach it. It is a minimum; add time in bad conditions."]],["pm210",1,["following distance","distans dèyè"],["Ki distans ou dwe kenbe dèyè yon moto?","De segonn, tankou nan vil","Omwen kat segonn","Menm twa segonn tankou dèyè yon machin","Longè yon machin","Kenbe omwen kat segonn dèyè yon moto, konpare ak twa segonn dèyè lòt veyikil."],["How much following distance should you keep behind a motorcycle?","Two seconds, like in town","At least four seconds","The same three seconds as a car","One car length","Keep at least four seconds behind a motorcycle, compared with three seconds behind other vehicles."]],["pm211",2,["heavy equipment","gwo ekipman"],["Ou dèyè yon kamyon fatra (dump truck). Ki distans mànyèl la rekòmande?","Twa segonn","Kat segonn","Omwen dis segonn","Senk longè machin","Kenbe omwen dis segonn dèyè gwo ekipman tankou kamyon fatra ak traktè, epi pa janm koupe devan yo: yo bezwen plis espas pou yo kanpe."],["You are behind a dump truck. What following distance does the manual recommend?","Three seconds","Four seconds","At least ten seconds","Five car lengths","Keep at least ten seconds behind heavy equipment such as dump trucks and tractors, and never cut in front of them: they need much more space to stop."]],["pm212",0,["stopping distance","distans pou kanpe"],["Sou yon wout sèk a 50 mph, anviwon ki distans sa pran pou w reyaji epi kanpe?","Anviwon 215 pye","Anviwon 50 pye","Anviwon 100 pye","Anviwon 500 pye","Anviwon 55 pye pandan w ap reyaji plis anviwon 160 pye fren: anviwon 215 pye an tout. Li pi long sou wout mouye oswa glise."],["On dry pavement at 50 mph, about how far does it take to react and stop?","About 215 feet","About 50 feet","About 100 feet","About 500 feet","About 55 feet while you react plus about 160 feet of braking: about 215 feet in total. It is longer on wet or slippery roads."]],["pm213",3,["antilock brakes (ABS)","fren antiblokaj (ABS)"],["Machin ou gen fren antiblokaj (ABS). Kisa ou PA dwe fè lè w ap fren fò?","Kenbe je w sou wout la","Dirije machin nan kote w vle ale","Kenbe de men w sou volan an","Ponpe fren yo","Pa janm ponpe fren antiblokaj. Fren bonè epi dousman lè w kapab, epi pa kite pye w poze sou pedal fren an."],["Your car has antilock brakes. What should you NOT do when braking hard?","Keep your eyes on the road","Steer where you want to go","Keep both hands on the wheel","Pump the brakes","Never pump antilock brakes. Also brake early and gently when you can, and do not rest your foot on the brake pedal."]],["p5",1,["headlights","limyè devan"],["Nan Massachusetts, lè w limen esuiglas ou (wipers), ou dwe tou:","Limen limyè ijans yo","Limen limyè devan ou","Desann a 25 mph","Sèvi ak gwo limyè","Chak fwa w sèvi ak esuiglas yo, limyè devan ak limyè dèyè yo dwe limen. Limyè lajounen pa ase."],["In Massachusetts, when you turn on your windshield wipers, you must also:","Turn on your hazard lights","Turn on your headlights","Slow to 25 mph","Use your high beams","Whenever you use your wipers, your headlights and taillights must be on. Daytime running lights are not enough."]],["pm214",2,["headlights","limyè devan"],["Kilè limyè devan w yo dwe limen, menm lè pa gen lapli?","Sèlman apre 9:00 p.m., nan tout sezon","Sèlman sou otowout","Depi demi èdtan apre solèy kouche rive demi èdtan anvan solèy leve","Sèlman lè l fin fè nwa nèt e limyè lari yo limen","Limyè yo limen depi demi èdtan apre solèy kouche rive demi èdtan anvan solèy leve, ak chak fwa w pa ka wè 500 pye devan, nan tinèl, ak lè lapli, nèj oswa bwouya."],["When must your headlights be on, even without rain?","Only after 9:00 p.m., in every season","Only on highways","From half an hour after sunset to half an hour before sunrise","Only when it is completely dark and the streetlights are on","Headlights go on from half an hour after sunset to half an hour before sunrise, and any time you cannot see 500 feet ahead, in tunnels, and in rain, snow or fog."]],["pm215",0,["low beams","limyè ba"],["Yon machin ap vin sou ou lannwit. Kilè ou dwe pase soti nan gwo limyè pou limyè ba?","Lè w a 500 pye de li","Lè w a 100 pye de li","Sèlman si l fè limyè l kliyote","Ou pa janm oblije","Pase nan limyè ba lè w a 500 pye yon machin k ap vin sou ou, ak 200 pye yon machin w ap swiv."],["A car is coming toward you at night. When must you switch from high beams to low beams?","Within 500 feet of it","Within 100 feet of it","Only if it flashes its lights","You never have to","Dim to low beams within 500 feet of an oncoming vehicle and within 200 feet of a vehicle you are following."]],["pm216",3,["glare","limyè ki avegle"],["Limyè machin k ap vin sou ou yo ap avegle w. Ki kote ou dwe gade?","Dirèkteman nan limyè yo","Nan retwovizè w jiskaske machin nan pase","Fèmen je w yon ti moman jiskaske l pase","Sou bò dwat anba vwa w","Pa gade dirèkteman nan limyè yo. Gade sou bò dwat anba vwa w. Si lòt chofè a kenbe gwo limyè l, rete adwat epi pa limen pa w."],["Oncoming headlights are blinding you. Where should you look?","Straight into the lights","At your rearview mirror until the car passes","Close your eyes for a moment until it passes","Toward the lower right side of your lane","Do not look straight at headlights. Look toward the lower right side of your lane. If the other driver keeps high beams on, stay right and do not turn yours on."]],["pm217",1,["emergency flashers","limyè ijans"],["Machin ou tonbe an pàn sou yon wout ki gen anpil machin. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Kanpe nan vwa w epi chanje kawoutchou a rapid","Rale toutotan ou kapab sou kote wout la epi limen limyè ijans yo","Etenn tout limyè w pou w pa fini batri a jiskaske èd rive","Kanpe dèyè machin nan nan liy lan pou fè siy pou machin yo kontoune","Rale toutotan ou kapab sou kote, limen limyè ijans yo, epi rete lwen wout la. Pa janm chanje yon kawoutchou plat nan yon vwa sikilasyon."],["Your car breaks down on a busy road. What should you do?","Stop in your lane and change the tire quickly","Move as far off the road as you can and turn on your emergency flashers","Turn off all your lights to save the battery until help comes","Stand behind the car in the lane to wave traffic around it","Pull as far to the side as you can, use your emergency lights, and stay off the road. Never change a flat tire in a traffic lane."]],["pm218",2,["drowsy driving","dòmi sou volan"],["Ki sèl vrè fason pou w evite kondui ak dòmi nan je?","Bwè kafe oswa yon bwason enèji anvan w pati","Louvri vit yo epi mete mizik fò","Dòmi ase, epi pa kondui lè w fatige","Kondui pi vit pou w rive lakay pi vit","Kafe oswa yon ti dòmi ede pou yon ti tan sèlman. Sèl vrè pwoteksyon an se dòmi ase. Aksidan akoz dòmi rive plis ant minwi ak 6 a.m."],["What is the only real way to prevent drowsy driving?","Drink coffee or an energy drink before you leave","Open the windows and play loud music","Get enough sleep, and do not drive when you are tired","Drive faster so you get home sooner","Coffee or a nap helps only for a short time. The only true protection is enough sleep. Drowsy crashes happen most between midnight and 6 a.m."]],["pm219",0,["hydroplaning","glise sou dlo"],["Machin ou kòmanse glise sou dlo sou yon wout mouye. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Lage pedal gaz la dousman; pa fren ni vire sanzatann","Frennen fò pou w kanpe anvan dlo a vin pi fon","Akselere pou kawotchou yo travèse dlo a","Vire volan an fò","Glise sou dlo vle di kawoutchou yo ap woule sou dlo. Ou twò vit: lage gaz la dousman. Si w fren oswa vire sanzatann, machin nan ka derape."],["Your car starts to hydroplane on a wet road. What should you do?","Slowly ease off the gas pedal; do not brake or turn suddenly","Brake hard to stop before the water gets deeper","Speed up so the tires push through the water","Turn the wheel sharply","Hydroplaning means your tires are riding on water. You are going too fast: ease off the gas slowly. Braking or turning suddenly can cause a skid."]],["pm220",3,["slippery road","wout ki glise"],["Kilè wout yo pi glise anjeneral lè lapli ap tonbe?","Apre lapli fin tonbe plizyè èdtan","Sèlman lannwit","Lè lapli a sispann","Lè lapli a fèk kòmanse","Wout yo souvan pi glise lè lapli fèk kòmanse melanje ak pousyè ak lwil sou wout la epi fè yon kouch grès. Ralanti depi lapli a kòmanse."],["When are roads usually most slippery in the rain?","After it has rained for several hours","Only at night","When the rain stops","When the rain first starts","Roads are often most slippery when rain first mixes with road dirt and oil and forms a greasy film. Slow down as soon as the rain starts."]],["pm221",1,["overpass","pon"],["Nan livè, ki pati nan wout la ki konn jele anvan?","Wout nan vil, bò kote bilding yo","Pon ak pasaj anwo wout","Wout k ap monte nan solèy","Pakin yo","Pon ak pasaj anwo wout jele anvan rès wout la paske tè a pa izole yo."],["In winter, which part of the road usually freezes first?","Roads in town, near buildings","Bridges and overpasses","Uphill roads in the sun","Parking lots","Bridges and overpasses freeze before the rest of the road because the ground does not insulate them."]],["pm222",2,["skid","derape"],["Machin ou derape sou yon wout glase. Ki bò ou dwe vire volan an?","Fò, nan direksyon opoze glisad la","Kenbe volan an dwat epi fren fò","Nan direksyon machin nan ap glise a","Sou bò wout la","Vire nan direksyon glisad la, epi pa janm bloke fren yo sou glas: fren ki bloke anpeche w dirije machin nan."],["Your car skids on an icy road. Which way should you steer?","Away from the skid, hard","Keep the wheel straight and brake hard","In the direction of the skid","Toward the shoulder","Turn into the direction of the skid, and never lock your brakes on ice: locked brakes take away your steering."]],["pm223",0,["negligent operation","neglijans nan kondui"],["Gen nèj anpile sou do machin ou. Kisa lalwa mande?","Retire l anvan w kondui, sinon yo ka akize w de neglijans nan kondui","Anyen; se sèlman vit devan an ak fenèt yo ki dwe klè","Kondui dousman pou nèj la pa vole sot sou do machin nan","Retire l sèlman pou otowout","Retire tout nèj ak glas: vit, esuiglas, limyè, do machin, kapo ak kòf, pou l pa vole sou machin dèyè w. Si w pa fè l, yo ka akize w de neglijans nan kondui."],["Snow is piled on your car's roof. What does the law expect?","Clear it before driving, or you can be charged with negligent operation","Nothing; only the windshield and windows must be clear","Drive slowly so the snow does not blow off the roof","Clear it only on highways","Remove all snow and ice: windows, wipers, lights, roof, hood and trunk, so it does not blow onto cars behind you. If you do not, you can be charged with negligent operation."]]],"3":[["pm302",0,["roadside worker","travayè bò wout"],["Kiyès nan moun sa yo ki se yon moun ki frajil sou wout la dapre lwa Massachusetts?","Yon moun ki monte cheval","Yon chofè kamyon","Yon pasaje bis","Yon chofè nan yon machin ki pake","Moun ki frajil sou wout la gen ladan pyeton, travayè bò wout, siklis, moun ki monte cheval, ak moun ki sèvi ak chèz woulant, moped, eskoutè, skateboard oswa paten."],["Which of these is a vulnerable road user under Massachusetts law?","A person riding a horse","A truck driver","A bus passenger","A driver in a parked car","Vulnerable road users include pedestrians, roadside workers, bicyclists, people riding horses, and people using wheelchairs, mopeds, scooters, skateboards or roller skates."]],["pm303",3,["backing up","fè bak"],["Machin ou gen yon kamera pou fè bak. Kisa ou toujou dwe fè anvan w fè bak soti nan yon antre kay?","Anyen; kamera a ase","Klaksonnen twa fwa","Fè bak vit pou w pa pase twòp tan nan wout la","Gade dèyè machin nan epi vire tèt ou pou w gade","Kwen avèg yo ka kache timoun oswa bèt. Gade dèyè machin nan anvan w monte, epi vire tèt ou gade nan fenèt la pandan w ap fè bak. Pa konte sèlman sou miwa oswa detektè."],["Your car has a backup camera. What should you still do before backing out of a driveway?","Nothing; the camera is enough","Honk three times","Back up quickly to limit the time in the road","Check behind the car and turn your head to look","Blind spots can hide children or animals. Check behind the vehicle before getting in, and turn your head and look out the window as you back up. Do not rely only on mirrors or sensors."]],["pm304",1,["Deaf or hard of hearing","soud oswa difikilte pou tande"],["Yon pyeton antre nan ri a san l pa gade machin ou. Ki sa ki pi san danje pou w panse?","Li tande w epi l ap kanpe","Li ka pa tande machin ou, kidonk bay dwa de pasaj","L ap vyole lalwa, kidonk ou ka kontinye","Klaksonnen ap toujou rezoud sa","Ou pa ka konnen lè w gade yon moun si l soud oswa si l gen difikilte pou tande. Li toujou pi san danje pou w bay dwa de pasaj, menm si se ou ki gen dwa a."],["A pedestrian steps into the street without looking toward your car. What is the safest assumption?","They heard you and will stop","They may not hear your car, so yield","They are breaking the law, so you may continue","Honking will always solve it","You cannot tell by looking whether someone is Deaf or hard of hearing. It is always safer to yield, even if you have the right-of-way."]],["pm305",2,["full lane","tout vwa a"],["Yon siklis ap woule nan mitan vwa a sou yon ri ki gen yon vwa bisiklèt. Kisa ki vre?","Li oblije sèvi ak vwa bisiklèt la","Ou ka klaksonnen jiskaske l deplase","Siklis yo ka sèvi ak tout vwa a, menm kote gen yon vwa bisiklèt","Bisiklèt pa gen dwa sou ri ki gen vwa bisiklèt","Siklis yo ka sèvi ak tout vwa a nenpòt kote, nenpòt lè, sou nenpòt ri sof otowout ak aksè limite ki make, menm kote gen yon vwa bisiklèt. Depase sèlman lè w ka kite omwen kat pye."],["A bicyclist is riding in the middle of the lane on a street that has a bike lane. Which is true?","They must use the bike lane","You may honk until they move","Bicyclists may use the full lane, even where there is a bike lane","Bicycles are not allowed on streets with bike lanes","Bicyclists can use the full lane anywhere, anytime, on any street except posted limited-access highways, even where there is a bike lane. Pass only when you can leave at least four feet."]],["pm306",3,["Dutch Reach","Dutch Reach (louvri ak lòt men an)"],["Ou pake sou yon ri ki gen anpil moun. Ki pi bon fason pou w louvri pòt ou?","Pouse l louvri vit pou w pa bloke wout la twò lontan","Louvri l yon ti kras epi tann","Limen siyal goch ou, apre sa louvri l","Gade miwa yo, apre sa louvri l ak men ki pi lwen pòt la","Gade miwa dèyè a ak miwa sou kote a, apre sa sèvi ak men ki pi lwen an (Dutch Reach). Kò w vire konsa ou wè siklis k ap vini yo. Louvri yon pòt sou yon siklis ka koute jiska $100."],["You parked on a busy street. What is the best way to open your door?","Push it open quickly so you are in the way for less time","Open it a little and wait","Turn on your left signal, then open it","Check your mirrors, then open it with the hand farther from the door","Check your rear-view and side mirrors, then use the far hand (the Dutch Reach). Your body turns so you see bicyclists coming. Opening a door into a bicyclist can cost up to $100."]],["pm307",1,["right hook","vire adwat devan siklis"],["Ou fèk depase yon siklis epi ou vle vire adwat nan pwochen antre a. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Vire touswit, devan l, anvan l rive nan antre a","Vire sèlman lè w byen lwen devan l, oswa kite l pase anvan","Klaksonnen pou l kanpe","Akselere pou w byen devan, apre sa frennen fò pou vire","Pa vire adwat sanzatann apre w fin depase yon siklis. Vire sèlman lè w byen lwen epi a yon vitès rezonab. Lalwa pèmèt bisiklèt woule sou bò dwat ou."],["You just passed a bicyclist and want to turn right at the next driveway. What should you do?","Turn right away, in front of them, before they reach the driveway","Turn only when you are a safe distance ahead, or let them pass first","Honk so they stop","Speed up to get well ahead, then brake hard to turn","Do not make an abrupt right turn after passing a bicyclist. Turn only at a safe distance and a reasonable speed. Bicycles may legally ride on your right."]],["pm308",0,["bicycle box","bwat bisiklèt"],["Nan yon limyè wouj, gen yon bwat vèt ak yon desen bisiklèt pentire devan pasaj pyeton an. Ki kote ou kanpe?","Dèyè bwat bisiklèt la, menm si l vid","Anndan bwat la si pa gen bisiklèt","Sou pasaj pyeton an","Nenpòt kote, depi w kanpe","Chofè yo dwe kanpe dèyè yon bwat bisiklèt, menm lè l vid, epi tann limyè vèt la."],["At a red light, a green box with a bicycle symbol is painted ahead of the crosswalk. Where do you stop?","Behind the bicycle box, even if it is empty","Inside the box if no bicycles are there","On the crosswalk","Anywhere, as long as you stop","Drivers must stop behind a bicycle box, even when it is empty, and wait for the green light."]],["pm309",2,["bicycle helmet","kas bisiklèt"],["Kiyès ki dwe mete yon kas bisiklèt nan Massachusetts?","Tout moun","Sèlman moun ki gen plis pase 18 an","Siklis ak pasaje ki poko gen 16 an","Pèsonn; se opsyonèl","Yon siklis oswa pasaje ki poko gen 16 an dwe mete yon kas apwouve sou wout piblik ak chemen bisiklèt. Kas yo diminye anpil lanmò ak blesi grav pou tout moun."],["Who must wear a bicycle helmet in Massachusetts?","Everyone","Only riders over 18","Riders and passengers under 16","No one; it is optional","A bicycle operator or passenger under 16 must wear an approved helmet on public ways and bike paths. Helmets greatly reduce deaths and serious injuries for everyone."]],["pm310",3,["motorcycle","moto"],["Yon moto ap woule sou bò goch yon vwa ki laj. Èske w ka vin kanpe bò kote l nan menm vwa a?","Wi, si vwa a laj ase","Wi, men sèlman lè sikilasyon an lan","Wi, si w mete siyal anvan","Non; pa janm pataje yon vwa ak yon moto","Yon moto gen dwa sèvi ak tout lajè yon vwa. Antre nan vwa li a ilegal epi danjere anpil, menm si vwa a laj."],["A motorcycle is riding on the left side of a wide lane. May you pull up beside it in the same lane?","Yes, if the lane is wide enough","Yes, but only in slow traffic","Yes, if you signal first","No; never share a lane with a motorcycle","A motorcycle has the right to the full width of a lane. Crowding into its lane is illegal and very dangerous, even if the lane is wide."]],["pm311",0,["left turn","vire agoch"],["W ap tann pou vire agoch. Yon moto k ap vini ap pwoche kafou a. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Kite moto a pase anvan","Vire vit devan l","Fè limyè w kliyote epi vire","Vire; moto ka kanpe vit","Machin ki vire agoch devan moto k ap vini lakoz anpil aksidan. Li difisil pou w konnen vitès yo, epi moun ki sou moto a ka pa gen tan ralanti. Kite moto a pase anvan."],["You are waiting to turn left. An oncoming motorcycle is approaching the intersection. What should you do?","Let the motorcycle pass through first","Turn quickly in front of it","Flash your lights and turn","Turn; motorcycles can stop quickly","Cars turning left in front of oncoming motorcycles cause many crashes. Their speed is hard to judge, and the rider may not have time to slow down. Let the motorcycle pass first."]],["pm312",1,["moped","moped"],["Ki règ ki aplike pou kondui yon moped (bisiklèt ak motè) nan Massachusetts?","Ou pa bezwen lisans ni pèmi si l pa depase 30 mph","Ou bezwen yon lisans oswa yon pèmi apranti, epi ou pa ka depase 25 mph","Ou ka monte sou gran wout si w rete nan liy dwat la","Kas se opsyonèl","Yon moped mande yon lisans (nenpòt klas) oswa yon pèmi apranti. Pa kondui pi vit pase 25 mph, mete yon kas DOT, epi pa monte sou otowout ak aksè limite. Ak yon pèmi, pa pote pasaje."],["Which rule applies to driving a moped (motorized bicycle) in Massachusetts?","No license or permit is needed if it goes under 30 mph","You need a license or learner's permit, and may not exceed 25 mph","You may ride on highways if you stay in the right lane","Helmets are optional","A moped needs a valid driver's license (any class) or learner's permit. Do not drive faster than 25 mph, wear a DOT helmet, and stay off limited-access highways. With a permit, carry no passengers."]],["pm313",2,["school bus","bis lekòl"],["Sou yon wout de vwa, yon bis lekòl k ap vin sou ou kanpe ak limyè wouj k ap limen etèn epi siy stop li louvri. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Ralanti epi pase ak prekosyon, paske l lòt bò wout la","Anyen; li sou lòt bò a","Kanpe epi rete kanpe jiskaske limyè yo sispann epi siy la fèmen","Klakonnen pou avèti timoun yo, apre sa ale","Ou dwe kanpe pou yon bis lekòl ki gen limyè wouj k ap limen etèn ak siy stop li louvri, kèlkeswa bò wout ou ye a. Menm apre l fin ale, kondui dousman epi veye timoun yo."],["On a two-lane road, a school bus coming toward you stops with red lights flashing and its stop sign out. What must you do?","Slow down and pass carefully, since it is on the other side of the road","Nothing; it is on the other side","Stop and stay stopped until the lights stop and the sign folds back","Honk to warn the children, then go","You must stop for a school bus with flashing red lights and its stop sign out, whichever side of the road you are on. Even after it moves, go slowly and watch for children."]],["pm314",3,["divided highway","otowout divize"],["Kilè ou PA oblije kanpe pou yon bis lekòl ki gen limyè wouj k ap limen etèn?","Lè w prese","Lè w pa wè okenn timoun bò bis la oswa bò wout la","Sou nenpòt wout ki gen kat liy, menm san baryè","Lè bis la sou lòt bò yon otowout divize ki gen yon baryè","Sèl eksepsyon an se yon bis lekòl ki kanpe sou lòt bò yon otowout divize ki gen yon baryè ant de direksyon yo."],["When are you NOT required to stop for a school bus with flashing red lights?","When you are in a hurry","When no children are visible near the bus or the road","On any road with four lanes, even without a barrier","When the bus is on the other side of a divided highway with a barrier","The only exception is a school bus stopped on the other side of a divided highway with a barrier between the directions."]],["pm315",0,["school bus violation","vyolasyon bis lekòl"],["Kisa premye vyolasyon lwa sou kanpe pou bis lekòl ka bay?","Yon sispansyon lisans ak yon amann $250","Yon avètisman ekri sèlman, san amann","Yon amann $25 e okenn lòt penalite","Yon Egzamen Pratik obligatwa","Premye vyolasyon lwa bis lekòl la ka lakoz yon sispansyon lisans ak yon amann $250."],["What can a first violation of the school bus stopping law bring?","A license suspension and a $250 fine","A written warning only, with no fine","A $25 fine and no other penalty","A required road test","A first violation of the school bus law can cause a license suspension and a $250 fine."]],["pm316",1,["trolley","trole"],["Yon trole kanpe epi pasaje ap desann. A ki distans ou ka kondui bò mach pasaje li a?","De pye","Pa pi pre pase uit pye","Nenpòt distans, si w kondui dousman","Senkant pye","Ou pa dwe kondui pi pre pase uit pye de mach pasaje yon trole pandan moun ap monte oswa desann. Yon trole pa ka devye pou evite w."],["A trolley is stopped and passengers are getting off. How close may you drive to its passenger step?","Two feet","No closer than eight feet","Any distance, if you go slowly","Fifty feet","You must not drive closer than eight feet to a trolley's passenger step while it is loading or unloading. A trolley cannot swerve to avoid you."]],["pm317",3,["blind spot","kwen avèg"],["W ap swiv yon gwo kamyon epi ou pa ka wè miwa sou kote l yo. Kisa sa vle di?","Ou nan yon bon distans dèyè kamyon an","Kamyon an pral vire oswa chanje liy","Miwa yo kase","Ou twò pre: chofè a pa ka wè w","Si w pa ka wè miwa yon kamyon, ou kole twò pre epi w nan kwen avèg li. Kamyon gen kwen avèg sou bò dwat, bò goch, devan ak dèyè."],["You are following a tractor-trailer and cannot see its side mirrors. What does that mean?","You are at a safe distance behind the truck","The truck is about to turn or change lanes","The mirrors are broken","You are too close: the driver cannot see you","If you cannot see a truck's rearview mirrors, you are tailgating and in its blind spot. Trucks have blind spots on the right, left, front and behind."]],["pm318",2,["wide turn","vire laj"],["Yon kamyon devan w deplase yon ti kras agoch ak siyal dwat li limen. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Pase l sou bò dwat pandan l ap deplase agoch","Klakonnen pou avèti chofè a se move siyal la ki limen","Rete dèyè; l ap louvri pou fè yon vire adwat ki laj","Vin kanpe bò kote l sou bò goch epi tann","Gwo veyikil vire laj epi yo ka ale agoch anvan yo vire adwat. Pa depase sou bò dwat; rete dèyè san danje jiskaske w konnen sa chofè a pral fè."],["A truck ahead of you moves slightly left with its right signal on. What should you do?","Pass it on the right while it moves left","Honk to warn the driver that the wrong signal is on","Stay behind; it is swinging out to make a wide right turn","Pull up beside it on the left and wait","Large vehicles make wide turns and may move left before turning right. Do not pass on the right; stay safely behind until you know what the driver is doing."]],["pm319",0,["slow-moving vehicle","veyikil ki mache dousman"],["Ou rive dèyè yon traktè fèm ki gen triyang zoranj sa a dèyè l. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Ralanti, fè atansyon, epi kite anpil espas si w depase","Pase l touswit sou bòdi a pou w pa pèdi tan","Klaksonnen jiskaske l rale sou kote","Swiv li kole pou lòt chofè pa ka antre devan w","Yon triyang zoranj make yon veyikil ki mache dousman tankou yon machin fèm oswa konstriksyon. Ralanti, trete l tankou yon siklis, epi kite anpil espas si w depase."],["You come up behind a farm tractor with this orange triangle on the back. What should you do?","Slow down, use caution and leave plenty of space if you pass","Pass it right away on the shoulder to save time","Honk until it pulls over","Follow it closely so other drivers cannot cut in","An orange triangle marks a slow-moving vehicle such as farm equipment or a construction rig. Slow down, treat it like a bicyclist, and leave plenty of room if you pass."],"smv"],["pm320",1,["funeral procession","kòtèj fineray"],["Yon kòtèj fineray ap pase nan yon limyè wouj nan yon kafou pandan limyè pa w la vèt. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Ale, paske limyè w vèt e se ou ki gen priyorite","Tann; pa travèse chemen l ni pase ant machin li yo","Antre nan ke konvwa a pou w pase limyè a","Klaksonnen pou avèti yo","Kòtèj fineray gen dwa de pasaj nan kafou yo. Ou pa ka travèse chemen yo menm ak limyè vèt, pase ant machin yo, ni antre nan kòtèj la."],["A funeral procession is going through a red light at an intersection while your light is green. What should you do?","Go, since your light is green and you have the right-of-way","Wait; do not cross its path or drive between its vehicles","Join the end of the procession to get through the light","Honk to warn them","Funeral processions have the right-of-way at intersections. You may not cross their path even on a green light, drive between their vehicles, or join the procession."]],["pm321",2,["horse","cheval"],["Ou pral depase yon moun ki monte cheval, epi cheval la sanble l pè. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Klaksonnen pou moun nan konnen ou la","Depase vit pou sa fini","Rale sou kote epi kanpe","Fè limyè w kliyote","Bay bèt yon moun ap monte oswa mennen dwa de pasaj. Ralanti epi pa klaksonnen. Si bèt la sanble l pè, ou dwe rale sou kote epi kanpe, epi ou dwe kanpe si moun ki sou li a fè w siy."],["You are about to pass a person riding a horse, and the horse looks scared. What must you do?","Honk so the rider knows you are there","Pass quickly to get it over with","Pull to the side and stop","Flash your headlights","Give the right-of-way to animals being ridden or led. Slow down and do not honk. If the animal looks scared, you must pull to the side and stop, and you must stop if the rider signals you to."]],["pm322",0,["aggressive driver","chofè agresif"],["Yon chofè agresif ap kole dèyè w epi l ap fè jès malelve. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Retire kò w nan chemen l, evite gade l nan je, epi pa okipe jès li yo","Frennen sou kou pou ba l yon leson","Akselere pou l pa ka swiv ou","Fè yon jès tou pou l konnen w wè l","Eseye retire kò w nan chemen yon chofè agresif. Pa defye l, evite gade l nan je, pa okipe jès malelve yo, epi kenbe senti w mare. Rele 911 pou rapòte yon ijans."],["An aggressive driver is tailgating you and making rude gestures. What should you do?","Get out of the way, avoid eye contact and ignore the gestures","Brake suddenly to teach them a lesson","Speed up so they cannot keep up with you","Make a gesture back so they know you saw them","Try to get out of an aggressive driver's way. Do not challenge them, avoid eye contact, ignore rude gestures and keep your seat belt on. Call 911 to report an emergency."]]],"4":[["pm402",3,["hearing","odyans"],["Ou mande yon odyans pou w konteste yon kontravansyon sivil. Kisa k ap rive ak frè $25 la si yo jwenn ou pa responsab pou tout vyolasyon yo?","Yo kenbe l","Li double","Li ale nan asirans ou","Yo remèt ou li","Mande yon odyans koute $25. Yo remèt ou frè a si tribinal la jwenn ou pa responsab pou tout vyolasyon ki sou kontravansyon an."],["You request a hearing to dispute a civil citation. What happens to the $25 filing fee if you are found not responsible for all violations?","It is kept","It doubles","It goes toward your insurance","It is refunded","A hearing request costs $25. The fee is refunded if the court finds you not responsible for all violations on the citation."]],["pm403",0,["criminal violation","vyolasyon kriminèl"],["Kiyès nan sa yo ki yon vyolasyon kriminèl?","Kite sèn yon aksidan","Depase limit vitès la 5 mph","Pa mete siyal","Yon kontravansyon pakin","Vyolasyon kriminèl gen ladan kite sèn yon aksidan, kondui anba enfliyans, ak kondui ak lisans sispann. Vitès ak pa mete siyal se vyolasyon sivil."],["Which of these is a criminal motor vehicle violation?","Leaving the scene of a crash","Going 5 mph over the limit","Failing to signal","A parking ticket","Criminal violations include leaving the scene of a crash, operating under the influence and driving with a suspended license. Speeding and failing to signal are civil."]],["pm404",2,["arrest","arestasyon"],["Yon polisye kanpe w epi l mande lisans ou. Ou refize montre l. Kisa ki ka rive?","Anyen, si w pa t ap fè vitès","Sèlman yon avètisman ekri","Yo ka arete w epi ou ka fè fas ak akizasyon kriminèl","Polisye a oblije kite w ale","Refize bay non ak adrès ou, montre lisans oswa anrejistreman, oswa siyen non w ka mennen nan arestasyon ak akizasyon kriminèl."],["A police officer stops you and asks for your license. You refuse to show it. What can happen?","Nothing, if you were not speeding","Only a written warning","You can be arrested and face criminal charges","The officer must let you go","Refusing to give your name and address, show your license or registration, or sign your name can lead to arrest and criminal charges."]],["pm405",1,["out-of-state violation","vyolasyon nan lòt eta"],["Ou jwenn yon kontravansyon vitès nan New Hampshire. Kijan sa afekte dosye w nan Massachusetts?","Li pa konte nan Massachusetts","Li konte menm jan ak si l te rive nan Massachusetts","Li konte sèlman si w te poko gen 18 an","Li konte sèlman apre twa kontravansyon","Vyolasyon nan lòt eta afekte dosye w menm jan ak si yo te fèt nan Massachusetts. Si w inyore yo, yo ka sispann lisans ou isit la."],["You get a speeding ticket in New Hampshire. How does it affect your Massachusetts record?","It does not count in Massachusetts","It counts as if it happened in Massachusetts","It counts only if you were under 18","It counts only after three tickets","Out-of-state violations affect your record as if they happened in Massachusetts. Ignoring them can lead to a suspension here."]],["pm406",3,["work zone","zòn travay"],["Yo kenbe w ap fè vitès nan yon zòn travay ki make. Kisa k ap rive ak amann lan?","Li menm jan ak tout lòt kote","Yo koupe l an de","Li tounen yon avètisman","Li double","Amann pou vitès double nan zòn travay ki make."],["You are caught speeding in a posted work zone. What happens to the fine?","It is the same as anywhere else","It is cut in half","It becomes a warning","It is doubled","Speeding fines are doubled in posted work zones."]],["pm407",0,["speeding fine","amann vitès"],["Dapre egzanp mànyèl la, konbyen amann total la ye si w kondui 73 mph kote limit lan se 55 mph?","$185","$100","$73","$360","Ou te depase limit lan 18 mph. Nan egzanp mànyèl la, 10 premye mph yo koute $105 (minimòm $100 plis $5 pou sekirite piblik), plis $10 pou chak nan 8 mph ki vin apre yo ($80): $185."],["Using the manual's example, what is the total fine for driving 73 mph where the limit is 55 mph?","$185","$100","$73","$360","You were 18 mph over. In the manual's example the first 10 mph cost $105 (the $100 minimum plus a $5 public safety surcharge), plus $10 for each of the next 8 mph ($80): $185."]],["pm408",2,["speeding violation","vyolasyon vitès"],["Ou se yon chofè granmoun yo jwenn responsab pou twa vyolasyon vitès nan 12 mwa. Kisa k ap rive?","Anyen anplis amann yo","Yon sispansyon yon ane","Yon sispansyon otomatik 30 jou","Ou dwe repase Egzamen Pratik la","Twa vyolasyon vitès nan 12 mwa bay yon sispansyon otomatik 30 jou. 12 mwa yo kòmanse lè w peye oswa yo jwenn ou responsab pou premye a."],["You are an adult driver found responsible for three speeding violations within 12 months. What happens?","Nothing more than the fines","A one-year suspension","An automatic 30-day suspension","You must retake the road test","Three speeding violations within 12 months bring an automatic 30-day suspension. The 12 months start when you pay or are found responsible for the first one."]],["pm409",1,["surchargeable event","evènman ki ka fè w peye plis"],["Kisa yon evènman ki ka fè w peye plis ye?","Nenpòt vwayaj sou yon wout peyaj oswa gran wout","Yon vyolasyon pandan w ap kondui oswa yon aksidan kote w an tò","Yon kontravansyon pakin","Renouvle lisans ou apre l fin ekspire","Vyolasyon pandan w ap kondui ak aksidan kote w an tò se evènman ki ka fè w peye plis. Chak konte pou yon sispansyon posib epi yo ka fè asirans ou monte."],["What is a surchargeable event?","Any trip on a toll road or highway","A moving violation or an at-fault crash","A parking ticket","Renewing your license after it expires","Moving violations and at-fault crashes are surchargeable events. Each one counts toward a possible suspension and can raise your insurance."]],["pm410",3,["Driver Retraining course","Kou Refòmasyon pou Chofè"],["Ou gen twa evènman ki ka fè w peye plis nan dezan. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Anyen pou kounye a; fòk gen sèt evènman","Peye yon amann $500 bay RMV nan 30 jou","Repase egzamen sou wout la nan 30 jou","Fè Kou Refòmasyon pou Chofè a nan 90 jou","Twa evènman nan dezan: fini Kou Refòmasyon pou Chofè a nan 90 jou, sinon lisans ou rete sispann jiskaske w fè l. Sèt evènman nan twazan bay yon sispansyon otomatik 60 jou."],["You have three surchargeable events within two years. What must you do?","Nothing yet; it takes seven events","Pay a $500 fine to the RMV within 30 days","Retake the road test within 30 days","Complete the Driver Retraining course within 90 days","Three surchargeable events in two years: finish the Driver Retraining course within 90 days, or your license stays suspended until you do. Seven events in three years bring an automatic 60-day suspension."]],["pm411",0,["at-fault crash","aksidan kote w an tò"],["Ki aksidan yo konn konte kòm se fòt ou?","Ou frape machin ki devan w lan pa dèyè","Yon chofè pase limyè wouj epi l frape w","Yon moun frape machin ou ki pake","Yon machin frape w pa dèyè nan yon siy STOP","Frape yon machin pa dèyè se youn nan règ ki di w an tò. Menm jan pou frape sou move bò wout la, pandan w ap fè bak, oswa frape yon machin ki pake."],["Which crash is usually counted as your fault?","You hit the car in front of you from behind","A driver runs a red light and hits you","Someone hits your parked car","A car rear-ends you at a stop sign","A rear-end collision is one of the standards of fault. So are crashing on the wrong side of the road, while backing up, or into a parked car."]],["pm412",2,["night restriction","restriksyon lannwit"],["Yo kenbe yon jèn 17 an ki gen pèmi ap kondui san okenn chofè ki gen lisans nan machin nan. Kisa k ap rive pou premye fwa?","Yon avètisman sèlman, paske se premye fwa","Yon amann $25 ak yon nòt nan dosye yo","Yon sispansyon 60 jou, epi li dwe repase egzamen pèmi a","Yon sispansyon twazan","Pou moun ki gen pèmi epi ki poko gen 18 an, kondui san chofè ki gen lisans bay yon sispansyon 60 jou premye fwa (180 jou, apre sa yon ane), epi chak fwa yo dwe repase egzamen pèmi a."],["A 17-year-old with a permit is caught driving with no licensed driver in the car. What happens for a first offense?","A warning only, since it is a first offense","A $25 fine and a note on their record","A 60-day suspension, and they must retake the permit exam","A three-year suspension","For permit holders under 18, driving without a licensed driver brings a 60-day suspension the first time (180 days, then one year), and every offense requires retaking the permit exam."]],["pm413",1,["Driver Attitudinal Retraining","kou refòmasyon atitid chofè"],["Yo kondane yon jèn chofè pou voye tèks pandan l ap kondui, premye fwa. Konbyen tan sispansyon an?","Okenn, se amann $100 ak yon lèt avètisman sèlman","60 jou, $100 amann, refòmasyon ak yon nouvo egzamen pèmi","Senk an, san lisans espesyal pou travay","Sèt jou, san lòt penalite","Jèn chofè: 60 jou premye fwa, 180 jou dezyèm fwa, yon ane apre sa. Premye fwa a gen $100 amann tou, yon kou refòmasyon atitid ak yon nouvo egzamen pèmi."],["A junior operator is convicted of texting while driving for the first time. What is the suspension?","None, only a $100 fine and a warning letter","60 days, a $100 fine, retraining and a new permit exam","Five years, with no hardship license","Seven days, with no other penalty","Junior operators: 60 days the first time, 180 days the second, one year after that. The first offense also brings a $100 fine, a Driver Attitudinal Retraining course and a new permit exam."]],["pm414",0,["drag racing","kous machin"],["Yo kondane yon jèn chofè pou kous machin premye fwa. Konbyen tan sispansyon an?","Yon ane","30 jou","90 jou","Pou tout lavi","Kous machin: yon ane pou premye fwa yon jèn chofè, twazan pou pwochen fwa, plis yon nouvo egzamen pèmi ak refòmasyon."],["A junior operator is convicted of drag racing for the first time. How long is the suspension?","One year","30 days","90 days","Lifetime","Drag racing: one year for a junior operator's first offense, three years for a later one, plus a new permit exam and retraining."]],["pm415",3,["suspended license","lisans sispann"],["Lisans ou sispann. Kisa ki vre?","Ou ka kondui pou w ale travay","Ou ka kondui nan yon lòt eta","Ou ka kondui ak yon granmoun ki gen lisans bò kote w","Ou dwe sispann kondui; si w kondui kounye a se yon vyolasyon kriminèl","Yon lisans ki sispann oswa revoke pa valab okenn kote. Kondui ak li se yon vyolasyon kriminèl ki ka bay gwo amann oswa prizon."],["Your license is suspended. What is true?","You may drive to work","You may drive in another state","You may drive with a licensed adult beside you","You must stop driving; driving now is a criminal violation","A suspended or revoked license is not valid anywhere. Driving with it is a criminal violation that can bring a large fine or jail."]],["pm416",2,["reinstatement","reyentegrasyon"],["Yo te sispann lisans ou pou dezan. Kisa ou dwe fè pou w jwenn li ankò?","Tann sèlman; li tounen otomatikman lè dezan yo fini","Peye yon frè sèlman, sou entènèt","Peye frè reyentegrasyon an epi repase egzamen pèmi a ak Egzamen Pratik la","Pase yon tès je sèlman, nan nenpòt sant sèvis RMV","Apre yon sispansyon dezan oswa plis, ou dwe repase egzamen pèmi a ak Egzamen Pratik la, epi peye yon frè reyentegrasyon."],["Your license was suspended for two years. What must you do to get it back?","Just wait; it comes back automatically when the two years end","Pay a fee only, online","Pay the reinstatement fee and pass the permit exam and road test again","Take a vision test only, at any RMV service center","After a suspension of two years or more, you must pass the permit exam and the road test again, and pay a reinstatement fee."]],["pm417",1,["fake ID","fo kat idantite"],["Yon moun sèvi ak lisans yon zanmi pou l eseye antre nan yon ba. Menm san kondanasyon, kisa RMV ka fè?","Anyen san kondanasyon","Sispann lisans li pou jiska sis mwa","Bay yon avètisman sèlman","Retire lisans zanmi an sèlman","Sèvi ak lisans yon lòt moun oswa yon fo kat idantite ka bay yon sispansyon jiska sis mwa san kondanasyon, ak yon ane apre yon kondanasyon."],["Someone uses a friend's license to try to get into a bar. Even without a conviction, what can the RMV do?","Nothing without a conviction","Suspend their license for up to six months","Give a warning only","Take away the friend's license only","Using someone else's license or a fake ID can bring a suspension of up to six months without a conviction, and one year after a conviction."]]],"5":[["pm501",3,["legal limit","limit lalwa"],["Pou chofè 21 an oswa plis, nan ki BAC ou depase limit lalwa a?","0.02","0.05","0.10","0.08","Ou depase limit lalwa a depi 0.08 oswa plis. Menm yon sèl vè ka afekte jan w kondui."],["For drivers 21 and older, at what BAC are you over the legal limit?","0.02","0.05","0.10","0.08","You are over the legal limit at 0.08 or higher. Even one drink can affect your driving."]],["pm502",0,["standard drink","yon vè alkòl"],["Ki bwason ki gen anviwon menm kantite alkòl?","Yon byè 12 ons, yon vè diven 5 ons ak 1.5 ons kleren 80 pwouf","Yon byè 12 ons ak yon vè diven 12 ons","Byè toujou gen mwens alkòl pase kleren, kidonk li pi san danje","Yon bwason melanje ak soda pa gen efè sou BAC","Yon byè 12 ons, yon vè diven 5 ons ak 1.5 ons kleren 80 pwouf (menm melanje ak soda) chak gen anviwon mwatye yon ons alkòl. Kalite bwason an pa enpòtan; se kantite a ki enpòtan."],["Which drinks hold about the same amount of alcohol?","A 12-ounce beer, a 5-ounce glass of wine and 1.5 ounces of 80-proof liquor","A 12-ounce beer and a 12-ounce glass of wine","Beer always has less alcohol than liquor, so it is safer","A mixed drink with soda has no effect on BAC","A 12-ounce beer, a 5-ounce glass of wine and a 1.5-ounce serving of 80-proof liquor (even mixed with soda) each hold about half an ounce of alcohol. The type of drink does not matter; the amount does."]],["pm503",2,["sober up","dezoule"],["Ki sèl bagay ki retire alkòl nan kò w?","Kafe nwa","Yon douch frèt","Tan","Manje yon gwo plat","Fwa w ak ren w bezwen tan pou yo trete alkòl la. Kafe, yon douch frèt, egzèsis oswa manje ka fè w santi w pi reveye, men yo pa bese BAC ou."],["What is the only thing that removes alcohol from your body?","Black coffee","A cold shower","Time","Eating a big meal","Your liver and kidneys need time to process alcohol. Coffee, a cold shower, exercise or food may make you feel more alert but do not lower your BAC."]],["pm504",1,["BAC","BAC"],["Anviwon konbyen yon vè alkòl ka fè BAC yon moun nòmal monte?","0.08","0.02","0.10","Li pa gen efè ou ka mezire","Chak vè ka fè BAC yon moun nòmal monte anviwon 0.02. Plis pase yon vè pa èdtan fè l monte; se tan sèlman ki fè l desann."],["About how much can one standard drink raise an average person's BAC?","0.08","0.02","0.10","It has no measurable effect","Each standard drink can raise an average person's BAC by about 0.02. More than one drink an hour makes it rise; only time brings it down."]],["pm505",0,["implied consent","konsantman implisit"],["Kisa Lwa Konsantman Implisit la vle di?","Lè w kondui, ou dakò fè yon tès souf oswa san si yo arete w pou OUI","Lapolis bezwen yon lòd tribinal anvan nenpòt tès souf oswa san","Ou ka refize tès la san penalite","Pasaje yo dwe fè tès tou","Chak chofè ki gen lisans dakò fè yon tès souf oswa san si yo arete l paske yo sispèk OUI. Si w refize, yo sispann lisans ou touswit."],["What does the Implied Consent Law mean?","By driving, you agree to a breath or blood test if arrested for OUI","Police need a court order before any breath or blood test","You may refuse the test with no penalty","Passengers must also be tested","Every licensed driver agrees to a breath or blood test if arrested on suspicion of OUI. Refusing brings an immediate license suspension."]],["pm506",2,["chemical test","tès chimik"],["Ou gen 30 an, ou pa janm gen OUI, epi ou refize yon tès souf apre yo arete w pou OUI. Pandan konbyen tan lisans ou sispann?","30 jou","Pa gen sispansyon","180 jou","Pou tout lavi","Refize yon tès chimik san okenn OUI anvan vle di 180 jou pou chofè ki gen plis pase 21 an. Polisye a pran lisans ou sou plas."],["You are 30, with no prior OUI, and you refuse a breath test after an OUI arrest. How long is your license suspended?","30 days","No suspension","180 days","Lifetime","Refusing a chemical test with no prior OUI means 180 days for drivers over 21. The officer takes your license on the spot."]],["pm507",1,["refusal","refi"],["Yon jèn 17 an ki pa janm gen OUI refize yon tès chimik. Konbyen tan sispansyon an?","180 jou","Twazan plis yon ane","30 jou","Pa gen sispansyon akoz laj li","Anba 18 an, refize san OUI anvan vle di twazan plis yon ane. Ane anplis la ka desann a 180 jou ak yon pwogram edikasyon sou alkòl apwouve si se premye ka OUI."],["A 17-year-old with no prior OUI refuses a chemical test. What is the suspension?","180 days","Three years plus one year","30 days","No suspension because of age","Under 18, refusing with no prior OUI means three years plus one year. The extra year can be cut to 180 days with an approved alcohol education program if this is a first OUI case."]],["pm508",3,["OUI","OUI"],["Konbyen tan yo sispann lisans pou premye kondanasyon OUI?","30 jou","Sis mwa","Pou tout lavi","Yon ane","Premye OUI bay yon sispansyon yon ane, amann $500 a $5,000 ak jiska 2 an edmi prizon. Tribinal la ka pèmèt yon pwogram edikasyon sou alkòl pou diminye sispansyon an."],["What is the license suspension for a first OUI conviction?","30 days","Six months","Lifetime","One year","A first OUI brings a one-year suspension, a $500 to $5,000 fine and up to 2½ years in prison. The court may allow an alcohol education program to shorten the suspension."]],["pm509",0,["crash risk","risk aksidan"],["Dapre mànyèl la, bwè alkòl fè risk aksidan an konbyen fwa pi gwo?","Senk fwa","De fwa","Li pa chanje risk la si w fè atansyon","Senkant fwa","Alkòl fè risk aksidan an senk fwa pi gwo; alkòl ak mariwana ansanm, douz fwa pi gwo."],["According to the manual, drinking alcohol makes a crash how much more likely?","Five times","Twice","It does not change the risk if you are careful","Fifty times","Alcohol makes a crash five times more likely; alcohol combined with marijuana, twelve times more likely."]],["pm510",2,["open container","veso ki louvri"],["Pasaje w ki gen 25 an ap kenbe yon bwat byè ki louvri pandan w ap kondui. Kisa ki vre?","Li legal, paske se pa ou k ap bwè","Li legal si bwat la nan yon sache papye","Sa ilegal: pa dwe gen okenn alkòl ki louvri anndan machin nan","Sa ilegal sèlman lannwit","Ou pa gen dwa gen yon bwason alkòl ki louvri anndan machin nan, menm si se yon lòt moun ki kenbe l. Amann lan se $100 a $500."],["Your 25-year-old passenger is holding an open can of beer while you drive. What is true?","It is legal, because you are not the one drinking","It is legal if the can is inside a paper bag","It is illegal: no open alcohol may be inside the vehicle","It is illegal only at night","You may not have an open alcoholic drink inside the vehicle, even if someone else holds it. The fine is $100 to $500."]],["pm511",3,["underage purchase","achte anba laj"],["Yon jèn 19 an eseye achte alkòl. Kisa k ap rive ak lisans li?","Anyen, paske li pa t ap kondui","Yon avètisman sèlman","Yon sispansyon 30 jou","Yon sispansyon 180 jou","Anba 21 an, achte oswa eseye achte alkòl bay yon sispansyon lisans 180 jou, menm si pa t gen kondui."],["A 19-year-old tries to buy alcohol. What happens to their license?","Nothing, because they did not drive","A warning only","A 30-day suspension","A 180-day suspension","Under 21, buying or trying to buy alcohol brings a 180-day license suspension, even though no driving was involved."]],["pm512",1,["marijuana","mariwana"],["Ki deklarasyon sou mariwana ak kondui nan Massachusetts ki vre?","Li legal pou w kondui apre w fin sèvi avè l, paske posede l legal","Kondui anba enfliyans li se yon krim, ak menm penalite ak OUI alkòl","Li amelyore vizyon lannwit","Li enpòtan sèlman pou chofè ki poko gen 21 an","Posede kèk mariwana pa yon krim ankò, men kondui anba enfliyans li toujou yon krim. Tablo penalite OUI a aplike pou mariwana. Li fè w wè mal lannwit tou."],["Which statement about marijuana and driving in Massachusetts is true?","It is legal to drive after using it, since it is legal to possess","Driving under its influence is a crime, with the same penalties as alcohol OUI","It improves night vision","It only matters for drivers under 21","Some marijuana possession is decriminalized, but driving under its influence is still a criminal offense. The OUI penalty chart applies to marijuana. It also harms night vision."]],["pm513",0,["over-the-counter medicine","medikaman san preskripsyon"],["Ou pran yon medikaman grip ki di li ka ba w dòmi. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Pa kondui; ou ka pa an kondisyon e yo ka menm akize w de OUI","Kondui, paske medikaman grip legal pou achte","Bwè yon kafe fò epi kondui","Kondui sèlman sou otowout","Anpil medikaman pou grip, alèji ak doulè ba w dòmi. Li ilegal pou w kondui lè yon sibstans, menm medikaman preskripsyon oswa san preskripsyon, afekte w."],["You took a cold medicine that warns it can cause drowsiness. What should you do?","Not drive; you can be impaired and even charged with OUI","Drive, since cold medicine is legal to buy","Drink a strong coffee and then drive","Drive only on highways","Many cold, allergy and pain medicines cause drowsiness. It is illegal to drive impaired by any substance, including prescription and over-the-counter drugs."]],["pm514",2,["failed test","echwe tès la"],["Yon jèn 17 an echwe yon tès souf ak BAC 0.03 (premye ka OUI). Konbyen tan sispansyon an?","Okenn, paske 0.03 pi ba pase limit 0.08 la","Sèt jou, apre sa lisans lan tounen otomatikman","30 jou plis yon ane, oswa 180 jou ak yon pwogram sou alkòl","Li pèdi lisans lan pou tout lavi","Anba 21 an, yon BAC 0.02 oswa plis bay penalite. Anba 18 an: 30 jou plis yon ane, ki ka desann a 180 jou ak yon pwogram edikasyon sou alkòl DPH apwouve nan yon premye ka OUI."],["A 17-year-old fails a breath test with a BAC of 0.03 (first OUI case). What is the license suspension?","None, because 0.03 is under the 0.08 limit","Seven days, then the license comes back automatically","30 days plus one year, or 180 days with an alcohol program","A lifetime loss of the license","Under 21, a BAC of 0.02 or higher brings penalties. Under 18: 30 days plus one year, which can be cut to 180 days with a DPH-approved alcohol education program in a first OUI case."]]],"6":[["pm601",2,["turn on red","vire nan wouj"],["Kilè ou ka vire adwat nan yon limyè wouj fiks nan Massachusetts?","Nenpòt lè, toutotan w ralanti epi gade anvan","Janmen; vire adwat nan wouj pa pèmèt nan Massachusetts","Apre w kanpe nèt epi bay priyorite, sof si yon siy entèdi l","Sèlman lè yon polisye fè w siy pou w pase","Ou ka vire adwat nan wouj apre w fin kanpe nèt epi bay pyeton ak lòt machin dwa de pasaj, men pa kote gen yon siy NO TURN ON RED."],["When may you turn right on a steady red light in Massachusetts?","Any time, as long as you slow down and look first","Never; right on red is not allowed in Massachusetts","After a full stop and yielding, unless a sign forbids it","Only when a police officer waves you on","Right on red is allowed after a complete stop and yielding to pedestrians and other vehicles, but not where a NO TURN ON RED sign is posted."]],["pm602",1,["one-way street","wout yon sèl sans"],["Kilè yo pèmèt vire agoch nan yon limyè wouj nan Massachusetts?","Janmen, okenn kote nan Massachusetts","Soti nan yon wout yon sèl sans pou antre nan yon lòt wout yon sèl sans, apre w fin kanpe nèt","Nenpòt lè pa gen machin k ap vin an fas, apre w ralanti","Sèlman lannwit","Ou ka vire agoch nan wouj sèlman soti nan yon wout yon sèl sans pou antre nan yon lòt wout yon sèl sans, apre w fin kanpe epi bay pyeton ak lòt machin dwa de pasaj."],["When is a left turn on a red light allowed in Massachusetts?","Never, anywhere in Massachusetts","From a one-way street onto another one-way street, after a complete stop","Any time there is no oncoming traffic, after slowing down","Only at night","You may turn left on red only from a one-way street onto another one-way street, after stopping and yielding to pedestrians and other vehicles."]],["pm603",3,["steady yellow","jòn fiks"],["Limyè devan w lan vin jòn fiks. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Akselere pou w pase","Ale, paske jòn vle di prekosyon sèlman","Kanpe menm si w deja nan kafou a","Kanpe si w ka fè l san danje","Yon jòn fiks vle di limyè a ap chanje soti vèt pou l vin wouj. Kanpe si l san danje. Si w deja kanpe, ou pa ka ale."],["The light ahead turns steady yellow. What should you do?","Speed up to get through","Go, because yellow means caution only","Stop even if you are already in the intersection","Stop if you can do so safely","A steady yellow means the light is changing from green to red. Stop if it is safe. If you are already stopped, you may not go."]],["pm604",0,["flashing yellow","jòn k ap limen etèn"],["Kisa yon limyè jòn k ap limen etèn vle di?","Ralanti epi pase avèk prekosyon","Kanpe epi tann vèt","Wout la fèmen","Pyeton yo dwe kanpe","Yon jòn k ap limen etèn se yon avètisman: pase avèk prekosyon, rete vijilan epi gade de bò nan kafou a."],["What does a flashing yellow light mean?","Slow down and go with caution","Stop and wait for green","The road is closed","Pedestrians must stop","A flashing yellow is a warning: proceed with caution, stay alert and look both ways at the intersection."]],["pm605",2,["flashing yellow arrow","flèch jòn k ap limen etèn"],["Ou vle vire agoch epi ou wè yon flèch jòn k ap limen etèn. Kisa sa vle di?","Machin k ap vin an fas yo dwe kanpe pou w ka vire","Ou pa ka vire agoch jiskaske flèch la tounen vèt","Lè gen yon bon espas, epi w bay machin k ap vini ak pyeton priyorite","Ou dwe vire vit anvan limyè a tounen wouj","Yon flèch jòn k ap limen etèn pèmèt ou vire pandan machin k ap vini yo gen limyè vèt, sèlman lè gen ase espas epi pa gen pyeton nan chemen w."],["You want to turn left and see a flashing yellow arrow. What does it mean?","Oncoming traffic must stop so you can turn","Left turns are not allowed until the arrow turns green","When there is a safe gap, yielding to oncoming traffic and pedestrians","You must turn quickly before the light changes to red","A flashing yellow arrow lets you turn while oncoming traffic has a green light, only when there is an adequate gap and no pedestrians in your path."]],["pm606",1,["dark signal","limyè etenn"],["Ou rive nan yon kafou kote limyè sikilasyon yo etenn nèt. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Pase; ou gen dwa de pasaj","Aji kòmsi gen yon siy STOP nan tout direksyon","Desann a 20 mph epi kontinye","Fè demi-tou","Si limyè yo etenn nèt, fè atansyon epi aji kòmsi gen yon siy STOP nan tout direksyon. Si yo ap limen etèn, swiv règ pou limyè k ap limen etèn yo."],["You reach an intersection where the traffic lights are completely dark. What should you do?","Go through; you have the right-of-way","Act as if there is a stop sign in all directions","Slow to 20 mph and continue","Turn around","If signals are blacked out, be cautious and proceed as though there is a stop sign in all directions. If they flash, follow the rules for flashing lights."]],["pm607",3,["oncoming traffic","machin k ap vini"],["W ap vire agoch sou yon limyè vèt won fiks (san flèch). Kiyès ou dwe bay dwa de pasaj?","Pèsonn, paske vèt vle di ale","Sèlman ak bis","Sèlman machin dèyè w ki vle pase","Machin k ap vini yo ak pyeton ki nan chemen w","Sou yon limyè vèt won, vire agoch pa pwoteje: bay machin k ap vini ak pyeton yo dwa de pasaj, epi pa janm bloke kafou a."],["You are turning left on a steady green circle (no arrow). Who must you yield to?","No one, because green means go","Only to buses","Only to vehicles behind you that want to pass","Oncoming traffic and pedestrians in your path","On a green circle, a left turn is not protected: yield to oncoming traffic and pedestrians, and never block the intersection."]],["pm608",0,["pedestrian beacon","limyè pou pyeton"],["Nan yon pasaj pyeton nan mitan yon blòk, limyè jòn zoranj ap limen etèn vit san ritm. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Kanpe pou pyeton yo","Akselere anvan yon moun travèse","Klaksonnen epi kontinye","Pa okipe l sof si gen yon limyè wouj tou","Se yon limyè rektang ki kliyote vit. Yon pyeton limen l: ou dwe kanpe pou pyeton pandan l ap limen etèn."],["At a mid-block crosswalk, amber lights are flashing rapidly in an irregular pattern. What must you do?","Stop for pedestrians","Speed up before someone steps out","Honk and continue","Ignore it unless there is also a red light","That is a rectangular rapid flashing beacon. A pedestrian has activated it: you must stop for pedestrians while it flashes."]],["pm609",2,["countdown timer","kontaj"],["Kontaj pyeton an rive a zewo pandan yon moun toujou nan pasaj la. Kiyès ki gen dwa de pasaj?","Ou menm, paske limyè w vèt","Moun ki klaksonnen anvan","Pyeton ki deja nan pasaj la","Machin k ap vire yo sèlman","Pyeton ki deja nan pasaj la lè kontaj la rive a zewo gen dwa de pasaj. Kite yo fin travèse."],["The pedestrian countdown reaches zero while a person is still in the crosswalk. Who has the right-of-way?","You, because your light is green","Whoever honks first","The pedestrian already in the crosswalk","Turning vehicles only","Pedestrians who are already in the crosswalk when the countdown reaches zero have the right-of-way. Let them finish crossing."]],["pm610",1,["crosswalk","pasaj pyeton"],["Machin ki nan vwa bò kote w lan kanpe nan yon pasaj pyeton. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Pase l ak prekosyon, pandan w ap gade pasaj pyeton an","Ralanti epi kanpe: pa janm depase yon machin ki kanpe pou yon pyeton","Klaksonnen pou avèti pyeton an","Chanje liy epi kontinye ak menm vitès la","Yon machin ki kanpe ka ap kache yon pyeton. Pa janm depase yon machin ki kanpe oswa k ap ralanti pou yon pyeton."],["The car in the lane next to you has stopped at a crosswalk. What should you do?","Pass it carefully, watching the crosswalk","Slow down and stop: never pass a vehicle stopped for a pedestrian","Honk to warn the pedestrian","Change to another lane and continue at the same speed","A stopped car may be hiding a pedestrian. Never pass a vehicle that is stopped or slowing for a pedestrian."]],["pm611",3,["orange sign","siy zoranj"],["Kisa siy zoranj yo vle di?","Gaz, manje ak lòt sèvis pou chofè","Zòn lwazi","Zòn lekòl ak travèse lekòl","Konstriksyon oswa antretyen devan","Siy zoranj avèti gen travay konstriksyon oswa antretyen. Ralanti epi veye travayè yo."],["What do orange signs mean?","Gas, food and other motorist services","Recreation areas","School zones and school crossings","Construction or maintenance ahead","Orange signs warn of construction or maintenance work. Slow down and watch for workers."],"work"],["pm612",0,["brown sign","siy mawon"],["Yon siy mawon anjeneral montre w:","Yon pak, yon zòn lwazi oswa yon sit istorik","Yon lopital oswa yon sal ijans","Yon sòti gran wout oswa yon wout ant eta","Yon detou pou kontoune travay","Siy mawon mennen nan zòn lwazi piblik, pak leta ak nasyonal, kote enteresan ak bèl peyizaj. Siy ble montre sèvis; siy vèt bay direksyon."],["A brown sign usually points you to:","A park, recreation area or historic site","A hospital or emergency room","A highway exit or an interstate route","A detour around construction","Brown signs lead to public recreation areas, state and national parks, points of interest and scenic sites. Blue signs show services; green signs give directions."]],["pm613",1,["prohibited","entèdi"],["Kisa siy sa a vle di?","Ou ka fè demi-tou pi devan","Pa fè demi-tou","Wout la fè yon koub sere","Detou devan","Yon sèk wouj ak yon ba an dyagonal vle di aksyon ki montre a entèdi. Isit la: pa fè demi-tou."],["What does this sign mean?","U-turn allowed ahead","No U-turn","Road curves sharply","Detour ahead","A red circle with a diagonal slash means the action shown is prohibited. Here: no U-turns."],"nouturn"],["pm614",3,["STOP sign","siy STOP"],["Ou rive devan siy sa a. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Ralanti, gade de bò, epi ale si pa gen pèsonn k ap vini","Kanpe sèlman si gen yon pyeton k ap tann pou travèse","Kanpe nan mitan pasaj pyeton an, kote w ka wè pi byen","Kanpe nèt anvan liy lan oswa pasaj pyeton an, bay priyorite, apre sa ale","Siy wouj uit kote a toujou vle di kanpe nèt, anvan pasaj pyeton oswa liy stop la. Ralanti sèlman pa ase."],["You come to this sign. What must you do?","Slow down, look both ways, and go if no one is coming","Stop only if a pedestrian is waiting to cross","Stop in the middle of the crosswalk, where you can see best","Stop completely before the line or crosswalk, yield, then go","The eight-sided red sign always means a complete stop, before any crosswalk or stop line. Just slowing down is not enough."],"stop"],["pm615",2,["school zone","zòn lekòl"],["Ki sa siy senk kote sa a avèti w?","Yon travèse tren devan","Yon zòn lopital","Yon zòn lekòl oswa yon pasaj lekòl","Yon zòn kote w pa gen dwa depase","Fòm pantagòn nan make yon zòn oswa yon pasaj lekòl. Limit vitès toupre lekòl se 20 mph; veye timoun ak gad travèse yo."],["What does this five-sided sign warn you about?","A railroad crossing ahead","A hospital zone","A school zone or school crossing","A zone where passing is not allowed","The pentagon shape marks a school zone or school crossing. The speed limit near schools is 20 mph; watch for children and crossing guards."],"school"],["pm616",0,["railroad crossing","wout tren"],["Ou wè siy jòn won sa a. Kisa ki devan?","Yon wout tren: ralanti epi pare pou kanpe","Yon wonpwen devan: kite machin ki ladan l pase","Yon lopital","Yon kafou devan ak yon siy stop","Yon siy avètisman won konn vini anvan yon wout tren. Ralanti, gade epi koute, epi pa janm eseye pase devan yon tren."],["You see this round yellow sign. What is ahead?","A railroad crossing: slow down and be ready to stop","A traffic circle (rotary) ahead: yield to cars in it","A hospital","A crossroad ahead with a stop sign","A round warning sign usually comes before a railroad crossing. Slow down, look and listen, and never try to beat a train."],"rr"],["pm617",1,["warning sign","siy avètisman"],["Kisa siy jòn an fòm dyaman sa a vle di?","Vire adwat kounye a, nan pwochen lari a","Wout la fè yon koub adwat pi devan: ralanti","Liy dwat la fini devan: antre agoch","Pa vire adwat","Siy jòn an fòm dyaman avèti gen danje oswa chanjman pi devan. Sa a avèti wout la fè yon koub adwat. Ralanti epi obeyi siy la."],["What does this yellow diamond sign mean?","Turn right now, at the next street","The road curves to the right ahead: slow down","The right lane ends ahead: merge left","No right turn","Yellow diamond signs warn of hazards or changes ahead. This one warns that the road curves right. Slow down and obey the sign."],"curve"],["pm618",2,["all-way stop","STOP nan tout direksyon"],["Nan yon kafou STOP nan kat direksyon, de machin rive nan lè diferan. Kiyès ki pase anvan?","Machin ki pi gwo a, paske l bezwen plis tan pou l kanpe","Machin k ap ale tou dwat la","Premye machin ki rive nan kafou a","Machin ki sou bò goch la","Nan yon kafou STOP nan tout direksyon (4-WAY), chak machin dwe kanpe, epi premye machin ki rive nan kafou a gen dwa de pasaj."],["At a four-way stop, two cars arrive at different times. Who goes first?","The larger vehicle, because it needs more time to stop","The car going straight","The first car to reach the intersection","The car on the left","At an all-way (4-WAY) stop, every vehicle must stop, and the first vehicle to reach the intersection has the right-of-way."]],["pm619",3,["YIELD sign","siy YIELD"],["Kisa siy sa a mande?","Kanpe nèt chak fwa","Akselere pou w ka antre anvan lòt machin yo","Anyen, si w ap vire adwat sou lòt wout la","Ralanti, kite lòt yo pase anvan, epi kanpe si sikilasyon an mande l","Nan yon siy YIELD, ralanti epi pare pou kanpe. Kite machin, siklis ak pyeton pase anvan w, epi kanpe nèt si sikilasyon an mande l."],["What does this sign require?","A complete stop every time","Speed up so you can merge before the other cars","Nothing, if you are turning right onto the other road","Slow down, let others go first, and stop if traffic requires it","At a YIELD sign, slow down and be ready to stop. Let vehicles, bicyclists and pedestrians go before you, and stop completely if traffic requires it."],"yield"],["pm620",1,["railroad gate","baryè wout tren"],["Limyè yo ap limen etèn nan yon wout tren. Ki kote ou dwe kanpe?","Dirèkteman sou ray yo","Omwen 15 pye de baryè a oswa poto limyè a","Ou ka fè wonn baryè a si w pa wè tren","Senk pye de ray yo","Kanpe omwen 15 pye anvan poto limyè a oswa baryè a epi rete kanpe jiskaske baryè a leve epi limyè yo sispann. Pa janm fè wonn yon baryè ki desann."],["The lights are flashing at a railroad crossing. Where must you stop?","Right on the tracks","At least 15 feet from the gate or light post","You may drive around the gate if no train is visible","Five feet from the tracks","Stop at least 15 feet before the light post or gate and stay stopped until the gate rises and the lights stop. Never drive around a lowered gate."]],["pm621",0,["work zone","zòn travay"],["W ap pwoche yon zòn travay. Ki premye bagay ou dwe fè?","Ralanti","Chanje vwa touswit","Limen gwo limyè ou","Gade travay y ap fè a","Premye bagay pou w fè nan yon zòn travay se ralanti, apre sa gade enstriksyon pou w pase san danje. Pa kite travay la distrè w."],["You are approaching a work zone. What is the first thing you must do?","Slow down","Change lanes immediately","Turn on your high beams","Look at the work being done","The first thing to do in a work zone is slow down, then look for guidance on how to get through safely. Do not be distracted by the work."]],["pm622",3,["flagger","moun ki gen drapo"],["Yon polisye k ap dirije sikilasyon an fè w siy pase nan yon limyè wouj. Kisa ou fè?","Tann limyè vèt la","Klaksonnen pou mande l si l sèten","Vire adwat pito","Swiv enstriksyon polisye a","Ou dwe toujou obeyi yon polisye sikilasyon oswa moun ki gen drapo, menm lè sa yo di diferan de siy, limyè oswa liy sou wout la."],["A police officer directing traffic waves you through a red light. What do you do?","Wait for the green light","Honk to ask if he is sure","Turn right instead","Follow the officer's direction","You must always obey a traffic officer or flagger, even when their directions overrule signs, signals or pavement markings."]],["pm623",2,["broken white line","liy blan an tire"],["Kisa yon liy blan an tire ant de vwa vle di?","Machin yo ale nan direksyon opoze; depase sèlman lè wout la klè","Ou pa ka janm travèse l, menm apre w fin bay siyal","Menm direksyon; ou ka travèse l pou chanje liy lè l san danje, apre w bay siyal","Li make yon liy pou bis ak taksi sèlman","Liy blan an tire separe vwa ki ale menm direksyon. Lè w fin mete siyal epi l san danje, ou ka travèse pou chanje vwa."],["What does a broken white line between two lanes mean?","Traffic goes in opposite directions; pass only when clear","You may never cross it, even after signaling","Same direction; you may cross to change lanes when safe, after signaling","It marks a lane for buses and taxis only","Broken white lines separate lanes going the same direction. Once you have signaled and it is safe, you may cross to change lanes."]],["pm624",1,["double solid yellow","de liy jòn solid"],["Kilè ou ka travèse de liy jòn solid?","Pou depase yon machin k ap mache dousman","Sèlman pou vire agoch, lè l san danje","Nenpòt lè pa gen machin k ap vini","Pa janm","De liy jòn solid entèdi depase. Ou ka travèse yo sèlman pou vire agoch lè l san danje."],["When may you cross double solid yellow lines?","To pass a slow vehicle","Only to turn left, when it is safe","Any time there is no oncoming traffic","Never","Two solid yellow lines prohibit passing. You may cross them only to turn left when it is safe."]],["pm625",0,["solid yellow line","liy jòn solid"],["Gen yon liy jòn solid sou bò kote w ak yon liy jòn an tire sou lòt bò a. Èske w ka depase?","Non; ou pa ka travèse lè liy solid la sou bò kote w","Wi, si wout devan an sanble klè","Wi, men sèlman lannwit","Wi, si machin devan an ap woule pi ba pase limit vitès la","Si liy jòn solid la pi pre w, ou pa ka travèse. Si liy an tire a pi pre w, ou ka travèse pou depase lè l san danje."],["There is a solid yellow line on your side and a broken yellow line on the other side. May you pass?","No; you may not cross when the solid line is on your side","Yes, if the road ahead looks clear","Yes, but only at night","Yes, if the car ahead is going under the speed limit","If the solid yellow line is closer to you, you cannot cross. If the broken line is closer to you, you may cross to pass when it is safe."]],["pm626",3,["bicycle lane","vwa bisiklèt"],["Kilè yon machin ka kondui nan yon vwa bisiklèt ki make?","Pou depase machin ki dousman sou bò dwat lè liy lan vid","Pou estasyone kèk minit ak limyè ijans ou limen","Nenpòt lè pa gen bisiklèt, si w ale dousman","Sèlman lè w ap vire antre oswa soti nan wout la, apre w fin gade si gen siklis","Machin yo ka sèvi ak yon vwa bisiklèt sèlman lè y ap vire antre oswa soti nan wout la. Gade byen si gen siklis epi travèse avèk prekosyon."],["When may a car drive in a marked bicycle lane?","To pass slow traffic on the right when the lane is empty","To park for a few minutes with your flashers on","Any time no bicycles are there, if you go slowly","Only when turning on or off the road, after checking for bicyclists","Motor vehicles may use a bike lane only when turning on or off the road. Look carefully for bicyclists and cross with care."]],["pm627",2,["high occupancy vehicle (HOV)","veyikil ak plizyè pasaje (HOV)"],["Gen yon dyaman blan pentire nan yon vwa. Kisa sa vle di?","Liy lan pral fini; antre kounye a","Wout tren devan","Yon vwa espesyal, tankou HOV oswa bis sèlman","Yon liy pou depase pou machin ki pi vit","Yon dyaman blan vle di yon vwa ki gen restriksyon espesyal, tankou machin ak plizyè pasaje sèlman (kovwatiraj) oswa bis sèlman."],["A white diamond is painted in a lane. What does it mean?","The lane ends soon; merge now","Railroad crossing ahead","A special lane, such as HOV or bus only","A passing lane for faster cars","A white diamond means a special lane restriction, like high-occupancy vehicles (carpools) only or buses only."]],["pm628",0,["yield line","liy yield"],["Kijan yon liy yield pentire atravè wout la sanble?","Yon ranje triyang","Yon sèl liy blan solid","Yon liy jòn doub","Yon dyaman blan","Yon liy yield sanble ak yon seri triyang pentire youn bò lòt. Yon liy stop se yon sèl liy blan solid. Kanpe dèyè yo lè yon siy, yon limyè oswa yon pyeton mande l."],["What does a yield line painted across the road look like?","A row of triangles","A single solid white line","A double yellow line","A white diamond","A yield line looks like a series of triangles painted side by side. A stop line is one solid white line. Stop behind them when a sign, signal or pedestrian requires it."]]],"7":[["p4",0,["school zone","zòn lekòl"],["Ki limit vitès nan yon zòn lekòl?","20 mph","25 mph","30 mph","35 mph","Sof si yon siy di yon lòt bagay, limit lan toupre lekòl se 20 mph. Li ka afiche ak limyè jòn k ap limen etèn oswa pou kèk lè nan jounen an. Veye timoun ak gad travèse yo."],["What is the speed limit in a school zone?","20 mph","25 mph","30 mph","35 mph","Unless posted otherwise, the limit near schools is 20 mph. It may be posted with flashing yellow lights or for certain hours. Watch for children and crossing guards."]],["p7",2,["thickly settled","zòn ki gen anpil kay"],["Lè pa gen siy limit vitès, ki limit lan nan yon zòn ki gen anpil kay oswa zòn biznis?","20 mph","40 mph","30 mph","50 mph","Limit leta a se 30 mph. Kèk vil mete 25 mph epi yo poze siy nan antre vil la, kidonk toujou swiv siy ki afiche yo."],["With no speed limit sign, what is the limit in a thickly settled or business district?","20 mph","40 mph","30 mph","50 mph","The state default is 30 mph. Some cities and towns have set 25 mph and post signs at their entrances, so always obey posted signs."]],["pm702",3,["limited-access highway","otowout ak aksè limite"],["Ki limit vitès yo afiche sou otowout ak aksè limite tankou wout entèetatik yo?","25 a 35 mph","70 a 80 mph","Pa gen limit","50 a 65 mph","Otowout ak aksè limite, tankou wout entèetatik yo, afiche ant 50 ak 65 mph. Ti otowout yo gen 55 mph oswa mwens."],["What speed limits are posted on limited-access highways such as interstates?","25 to 35 mph","70 to 80 mph","There is no limit","50 to 65 mph","Limited-access highways, like interstate routes, are posted from 50 to 65 mph. Smaller highways are 55 mph or lower."]],["pm703",1,["minimum speed","vitès minimòm"],["Ki vitès minimòm sou Massachusetts Turnpike?","Pa genyen","40 mph","20 mph","55 mph","Massachusetts Turnpike gen yon minimòm 40 mph; tinèl Boston Harbor yo gen yon minimòm 20 mph. Lapolis ka fè yon chofè k ap ralanti sikilasyon an rale sou kote tou."],["What is the minimum speed on the Massachusetts Turnpike?","There is none","40 mph","20 mph","55 mph","The Massachusetts Turnpike has a 40 mph minimum; the Boston Harbor tunnels have a 20 mph minimum. Police can also pull over a driver who is slowing traffic."]],["pm704",0,["thickly settled district","zòn ki gen anpil kay"],["Kisa ki fè yon zòn se yon zòn ki gen anpil kay?","Bilding yo mwens pase 200 pye youn de lòt sou yon ka mil oswa plis","Nenpòt wout ki gen yon twotwa sou yon bò","Plis pase 1,000 machin pa jou pase nan zòn nan","Nenpòt wout andedan limit yon vil","Yon zòn ki gen anpil kay gen bilding mwens pase 200 pye youn de lòt sou yon ka mil oswa plis. Limit pa defo a se 30 mph."],["What makes an area a thickly settled district?","Buildings less than 200 feet apart for a quarter mile or more","Any road that has a sidewalk on one side","More than 1,000 cars a day pass through the area","Any road inside a city or town limit","A thickly settled district has buildings fewer than 200 feet apart for a quarter mile or more. The default limit there is 30 mph."]],["pm705",3,["pedestrian","pyeton"],["Yon machin frape yon pyeton a 40 mph. Anviwon ki pòsyon pyeton ki blese grav oswa mouri nan vitès sa a?","13%","25%","40%","73%","A 20 mph, 13% pyeton blese grav oswa mouri; a 30 mph, 40%; a 40 mph, 73%. Vitès machin yo se pi gwo menas pou pyeton."],["A car hits a pedestrian at 40 mph. About what share of pedestrians are seriously injured or killed at that speed?","13%","25%","40%","73%","At 20 mph, 13% of pedestrians are seriously injured or killed; at 30 mph, 40%; at 40 mph, 73%. Vehicle speed is the leading threat to pedestrians."]],["pm706",1,["hand signal","siyal ak men"],["Siyal machin ou yo pa mache ankò. Kijan pou w fè siyal vire adwat ak men?","Bra goch lonje tou dwat","Bra goch pliye monte anlè nan koud la","Bra goch pliye desann anba","Fè bra w fè wonn","Siyal ak men fèt nan fenèt chofè a: bra lonje tou dwat pou agoch, bra pliye anlè pou adwat, bra pliye anba pou ralanti oswa kanpe. Ou dwe konnen yo pou w pase Egzamen Pratik la."],["Your turn signals stop working. How do you signal a right turn by hand?","Left arm straight out","Left arm bent up at the elbow","Left arm bent down","Wave your arm in a circle","Hand signals are made through the driver's window: arm straight out for left, arm bent up for right, arm bent down to slow or stop. You must know them to pass the road test."]],["pm707",0,["right lane","vwa dwat"],["Sou yon wout ki gen de vwa nan direksyon w, ki vwa ou dwe sèvi anjeneral?","Vwa dwat la, sof si w ap depase, vire agoch, oswa l bloke","Liy goch la, paske se liy ki pi vit la","Nenpòt liy, sa ki gen mwens machin nan moman an","Woule ant de liy yo pou pèsonn pa ka depase w","Sèvi ak vwa dwat la sof si w ap depase, w ap vire agoch, oswa vwa dwat la bloke."],["On a road with two lanes going your way, which lane should you normally use?","The right lane, unless passing, turning left, or it is blocked","The left lane, because it is the faster lane","Either lane, whichever has less traffic at the moment","Straddle both lanes so no one can pass you","Use the right lane unless you are passing, making a left turn, or the right lane is blocked."]],["pm708",2,["exit","sòti"],["Ou rate sòti w sou otowout la. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Kanpe sou bò wout la epi fè bak","Fè demi-tou atravè mitan an","Kontinye jiska pwochen sòti a","Kanpe nan vwa a epi tann","Si w rate sòti w, pa kanpe e pa janm fè bak sou otowout. Soti nan pwochen sòti a epi swiv siy yo pou w retounen."],["You miss your exit on the highway. What should you do?","Stop on the shoulder and back up","Make a U-turn across the median","Continue to the next exit","Stop in the lane and wait","If you miss your exit, do not stop and never back up on a highway. Get off at the next exit and follow signs back."]],["pm709",1,["turn signal","siyal vire"],["A ki distans anvan yon vire sou yon wout nòmal ou dwe mete siyal?","25 pye","Omwen 100 pye","Omwen 500 pye","Sèlman lè w ap vire","Mete siyal omwen 100 pye anvan yon vire, ak omwen 500 pye sou otowout. Mete siyal anvan w fren pou lòt moun konnen sa w pral fè."],["How far before a turn on a regular road must you signal?","25 feet","At least 100 feet","At least 500 feet","Only as you turn","Signal at least 100 feet before a turn, and at least 500 feet on a highway. Signal before you brake so others know what you plan."]],["pm710",3,["highway exit","sòti otowout"],["A ki distans anvan yon sòti otowout ou dwe mete siyal?","50 pye","100 pye, jis anvan bretèl la","1 mil","Omwen 500 pye","Mete siyal sòti w omwen 500 pye anvan ranp lan, apre sa ralanti pou vitès ki afiche sou ranp lan lè w rive sou li."],["How far before a highway exit should you signal?","50 feet","100 feet, just before the ramp","1 mile","At least 500 feet","Signal your exit at least 500 feet before the ramp, then slow to the posted ramp speed once you are on it."]],["pm711",2,["passing lane","vwa pou depase"],["Sou yon otowout ki gen twa vwa nan direksyon w, pou kisa vwa ki pi agoch la ye?","Kamyon","Kondui dousman","Depase","Machin an pàn","Ak twa vwa oswa plis: vwa ki pi adwat la pou kondui pi dousman, vwa mitan an pou kondui pi vit, vwa ki pi agoch la pou depase."],["On an expressway with three lanes your way, what is the far left lane for?","Trucks","Slow driving","Passing","Breakdowns","With three or more lanes: the far right lane for slower driving, the middle lane for faster driving, the far left lane for passing."]],["pm712",0,["U-turn","demi-tou"],["Ki kote ou PA ka fè demi-tou, menm si pa gen siy?","Toupre yon koub oswa tèt mòn kote chofè pa ka wè 500 pye","Sou yon lari dwat e klè kote w wè byen","Soti nan vwa ki pi pre liy mitan an","Sou yon wout trankil ki pa gen anpil machin","Pa fè demi-tou sou tèt yon mòn, toupre yon koub, oswa nenpòt kote ou menm oswa lòt moun pa ka wè 500 pye. Fè l sèlman soti nan vwa ki pi pre liy mitan an."],["Where may you NOT make a U-turn, even with no sign?","Near a curve or hilltop where drivers cannot see 500 feet","On a straight, clear street with good visibility","From the lane nearest the center line","On a quiet road with light traffic","Do not make a U-turn at the top of a hill, near a curve, or anywhere you or others cannot see 500 feet away. Make it only from the lane closest to the center line."]],["pm713",3,["center turn lane","vwa mitan pou vire"],["Yon wout de sans gen yon vwa mitan pou vire agoch nan de direksyon. Kisa ki vre?","Ou ka sèvi avè l pou depase","Li pou yon sèl direksyon","Ou ka kondui ladan l sou yon long distans","Li sèlman pou vire agoch; ou pa ka kondui ladan l","Yon vwa mitan ki make pou vire agoch se pou de direksyon yo pataje sèlman pou vire. Ou pa ka kondui ladan l."],["A two-way road has a shared center left-turn lane. Which is true?","You may use it to pass","It is for one direction only","You may drive in it for long distances","It is only for left turns; you may not travel in it","A center lane marked for left turns is shared by both directions for turning only. You may not travel in it."]],["pm714",1,["turning lane","vwa pou vire"],["Ki vwa ou dwe sèvi pou vire agoch sou yon wout ki gen plizyè vwa?","Vwa ki pi adwat la","Vwa ki pi pre mitan an","Nenpòt vwa, si w mete siyal","Vwa pàn nan","Vire soti nan vwa ki pi pre vwa w vle antre a: vire agoch soti nan vwa ki pi pre mitan an, vire adwat soti nan vwa ki pi adwat la. Chanje vwa apre vire a si w bezwen."],["From which lane should you make a left turn on a multi-lane road?","The far right lane","The lane closest to the center","Any lane, if you signal","The breakdown lane","Turn from the lane closest to the lane you want to enter: left turns from the lane nearest the center, right turns from the far right lane. Change lanes after the turn if you need to."]],["pm715",0,["uncontrolled intersection","kafou san siy"],["Nan yon kafou ki pa gen siy ni limyè, yon lòt machin rive sou bò dwat ou an menm tan. Kiyès ki pase anvan?","Machin ki sou bò dwat ou a","Ou menm, si w ap kontinye dwat","Machin ki pi vit la","Moun ki klaksonnen an","Nan yon kafou san siy, bay nenpòt machin ki antre oswa k ap vini sou bò dwat ou dwa de pasaj. Kontinye veye machin ki sou bò goch yo tou."],["At an intersection with no signs or signals, another car arrives from your right at the same time. Who goes first?","The car on your right","You do, if you are going straight","The faster car","Whoever honks","At an uncontrolled intersection, yield to any vehicle that has entered from your right or is coming from your right. Still watch traffic from the left."]],["pm716",2,["four-way stop","STOP nan kat direksyon"],["Nan yon kafou STOP nan kat direksyon, ou menm ak machin ki sou bò dwat ou kanpe an menm tan. Kisa ou fè?","Pase anvan, paske w sou bò goch","Nou toulède pase an menm tan","Bay machin ki sou bò dwat ou a dwa de pasaj","Klaksonnen epi pase","Machin yo pase nan lòd yo te kanpe a. Si de kanpe an menm tan, bay sa ki sou bò dwat ou a dwa de pasaj. Gade chofè yo nan je ede evite konfizyon."],["At a four-way stop, you and the car on your right stop at the same time. What do you do?","Go first, since you are on the left","Both go at once","Yield to the car on your right","Honk and go","Vehicles go in the order they stopped. If two stop at the same time, yield to the one on your right. Eye contact helps avoid confusion."]],["pm717",3,["White Cane Law","Lwa Baton Blan"],["Yon moun ki gen yon baton blan ap travèse ri a devan w. Kisa lalwa mande?","Klakonnen yon fwa pou l konnen w la","Fè l siy pou l travèse","Kondui dousman otou l, epi kite anpil espas","Kanpe nèt epi rete kanpe jiskaske l fin travèse","Lwa Baton Blan an mande pou w kanpe nèt pou yon pyeton avèg k ap travèse. Rete kanpe jiskaske l fin travèse; pa klaksonnen ni fè siy, epi pa janm depase yon lòt machin ki kanpe."],["A person with a white cane is crossing the street in front of you. What does the law require?","Honk once so they know you are there","Wave them across","Drive slowly around them, leaving plenty of room","Stop completely and stay stopped until they have crossed","The White Cane Law requires a complete stop for a blind pedestrian crossing. Stay stopped until they are across; do not honk or wave, and never pass another stopped vehicle."]],["pm718",1,["driveway","antre kay"],["W ap soti nan yon antre kay pou antre sou yon ri asfalte. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Klakonnen pou avèti lòt moun, apre sa sòti","Kanpe epi bay pyeton, siklis ak machin ki sou ri a dwa de pasaj","Sòti vit anvan plis machin rive","Sòti dousman, paske machin nan lari a dwe kanpe pou ou","Lè w ap antre sou yon wout asfalte soti nan yon wout prive, yon antre kay oswa yon wout tè, ou dwe kanpe epi bay pyeton, siklis ak machin ki sou wout sa a dwa de pasaj."],["You are pulling out of a driveway onto a paved street. What must you do?","Honk to warn others, then pull out","Stop and yield to pedestrians, bicyclists and vehicles on the street","Pull out quickly before more traffic arrives","Pull out slowly, since traffic on the street must stop for you","Entering a paved road from a private road, driveway or unpaved road, you must stop and give the right-of-way to pedestrians, bicyclists and vehicles on that road."]],["pm719",0,["divided highway","otowout divize"],["Ou sou yon wout de vwa epi w rive nan yon kafou ak yon otowout divize. Kiyès ki gen dwa de pasaj?","Machin ki sou otowout divize a","Ou menm, si w rive anvan","Moun ki pi vit la","Ou menm, paske w sou bò dwat","Si w sou yon wout yon oswa de vwa epi w rive nan yon otowout divize oswa yon wout twa vwa oswa plis, ou dwe bay dwa de pasaj."],["You are on a two-lane road and reach an intersection with a divided highway. Who has the right-of-way?","Traffic on the divided highway","You, if you arrive first","Whoever is going faster","You, because you are on the right","If you are on a single or two-lane road and come to a divided highway or a road with three or more lanes, you must yield the right-of-way."]],["p3",1,["rotary","kafou won"],["W ap antre nan yon kafou won. Kiyès ki gen dwa de pasaj?","Ou menm, paske w sou bò dwat","Machin ki deja nan kafou won an","Machin ki pi gwo a","Moun ki klaksonnen an premye","Sikilasyon nan yon kafou won nan Massachusetts fè wonn nan sans kontrè egui yon revèy. Bay machin ki deja nan kafou won an ak pyeton yo dwa de pasaj, sof si siy oswa lapolis di yon lòt bagay."],["You are entering a rotary. Who has the right-of-way?","You, because you are on the right","Vehicles already in the rotary","The larger vehicle","Whoever honks first","Traffic in a Massachusetts rotary moves counterclockwise. Yield to vehicles already in the rotary and to pedestrians, unless signs or police say otherwise."]],["pm720",3,["counterclockwise","kontrè egui yon revèy"],["Nan ki direksyon machin yo fè wonn nan yon kafou won Massachusetts?","Nan sans egui yon revèy","Nenpòt sans","Sans ki pi kout la","Nan sans kontrè egui yon revèy","Sikilasyon nan yon kafou won toujou fè wonn nan sans kontrè egui yon revèy, toutotou zile mitan an."],["Which way does traffic travel in a Massachusetts rotary?","Clockwise","Either way","Whichever way is shorter","Counterclockwise","Traffic in a rotary always travels counterclockwise, around the central island."]],["pm721",0,["multi-lane rotary","kafou won ak plizyè vwa"],["Nan yon kafou won ak plizyè vwa san siy, ou vle fè demi-tou. Nan ki vwa ou dwe antre?","Vwa goch la, apre sa soti nan vwa dwat la","Vwa dwat la, epi rete adwat tout chemen an","Nenpòt vwa, apre sa koupe travèse","Vwa pàn nan","Pou twa ka vire oswa demi-tou san siy, antre nan vwa goch la, kondui nan vwa anndan an, epi soti nan vwa dwat la. Pou yon ka vire oswa tou dwat, sèvi ak vwa dwat la."],["In a multi-lane rotary with no signs, you want to make a U-turn. Which lane should you enter from?","The left lane, then exit to the right lane","The right lane, and stay right the whole way","Any lane, then cut across","The breakdown lane","For a three-quarter turn or U-turn with no signs, enter from the left lane, travel in the inner lane, and exit onto the right lane. For a quarter turn or straight ahead, use the right lane."]],["pm722",2,["roundabout","wonpwen piti"],["Konpare ak yon kafou won, ki vitès yon wonpwen piti mande?","Jiska 40 mph","Vitès otowout","25 mph oswa mwens","Omwen 30 mph","Wonpwen piti yo pi piti pase kafou won yo, ak liy yield ak pasaj pyeton, epi gwosè yo mande vitès 25 mph oswa mwens. Gwo kafou won yo ka resevwa machin jiska 40 mph."],["Compared with a rotary, a roundabout requires what speed?","Up to 40 mph","Highway speed","25 mph or less","At least 30 mph","Roundabouts are smaller than rotaries, with yield lines and crosswalks, and their size requires speeds of 25 mph or less. Big rotaries handle traffic up to 40 mph."]],["pm723",1,["courtesy crash","aksidan politès"],["W ap tann pou vire agoch. Yon chofè nan machin ki kanpe yo fè w siy pase. Kisa ki vre?","Siy la ba w priyorite sou tout lòt machin","Machin k ap vini yo toujou gen dwa de pasaj; vire sèlman lè w wè wout la klè","Ou dwe vire touswit pou w pa bloke sikilasyon an","Chofè ki fè siy la responsab nenpòt aksidan ki rive apre","Fè moun siy pase nan mitan machin ki kanpe lakoz aksidan politès. Machin k ap vini yo gen dwa de pasaj kit yon moun fè w siy kit li pa fè w siy."],["You are waiting to turn left. A driver in stopped traffic waves you through. What is true?","The wave gives you the right-of-way over all other traffic","Oncoming traffic still has the right-of-way; turn only when you can see it is clear","You must turn right away so you do not hold up traffic","The driver who waved is responsible for any crash that follows","Waving people through stopped traffic causes courtesy crashes. Oncoming traffic has the right-of-way whether or not someone waves at you."]],["pm724",3,["passing","depase"],["Ou vle travèse yon liy jòn an tire pou depase. Ki distans devan ou dwe ka wè klè?","100 pye","Omwen 200 pye","1,000 pye","Omwen 400 pye","Pou travèse yon liy jòn an tire pou depase, ou dwe ka wè omwen 400 pye devan, epi ou dwe retounen nan vwa w anvan nenpòt machin k ap vini rive a 200 pye."],["You want to cross a broken yellow line to pass. How far ahead must you be able to see clearly?","100 feet","At least 200 feet","1,000 feet","At least 400 feet","To cross a broken yellow line to pass, you must see at least 400 feet ahead, and you must be back in your lane before any oncoming vehicle comes within 200 feet."]],["pm725",2,["returning to lane","retounen nan vwa"],["Apre w fin depase, kilè li san danje pou w retounen nan vwa dwat la?","Depi pare-chòk devan w fin pase lòt machin nan","Apre w fin klaksonnen","Lè w ka wè limyè devan machin ou depase a nan miwa w","Sèlman nan pwochen kafou a","Tann omwen jiskaske w wè limyè devan machin ou depase a nan miwa w, mete siyal adwat, epi retounen anvan machin k ap vini yo rive a 200 pye."],["After passing, when is it safe to move back into the right lane?","As soon as your front bumper is past the other car","After you honk","When you can see the passed vehicle's headlights in your mirror","Only at the next intersection","Wait at least until you can see the passed vehicle's headlights in your mirror, signal right, and return before oncoming traffic is within 200 feet."]],["pm726",0,["passing on the right","depase sou bò dwat"],["Kilè ou ka depase yon lòt machin sou bò dwat?","Lè l ap vire agoch epi gen espas","Nenpòt lè l ap mache twò dousman","Sou bò wout la","Pa janm","Ou ka depase sou bò dwat sèlman lè machin nan ap vire agoch, sou yon wout yon sèl sans, oswa sou yon wout kote machin yo ale nan yon sèl direksyon, epi wout la laj e klè. Pa janm sèvi ak bò wout la."],["When may you pass another vehicle on the right?","When it is turning left and there is room","Any time it is going too slowly","Using the shoulder","Never","Passing on the right is allowed only when the vehicle is turning left, on a one-way street, or on a road where traffic moves one way, and the road is wide and clear. Never use the shoulder."]],["pm727",1,["being passed","yon moun ap depase w"],["Yon lòt machin ap depase w. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Akselere pou l pa ka pase devan w","Ralanti epi rete adwat","Deplase agoch pou bloke l","Fren fò","Lè yon moun ap depase w, ralanti, rete adwat, epi kite lòt chofè a pase san danje. Pa akselere."],["Another car is passing you. What should you do?","Speed up so it can't get in front","Slow down and keep to the right","Move to the left to block it","Brake hard","When you are being passed, slow down, stay to the right, and let the other driver pass safely. Do not speed up."]],["pm728",3,["move-over law","lwa «move-over»"],["Sou yon otowout kat vwa, yon machin lapolis kanpe sou bò wout la ak limyè l k ap limen etèn. Kisa lwa «move-over» a mande?","Anyen, toutotan w rete nan liy ou epi kenbe vitès ou","Kanpe dèyè machin polis la jiskaske l ale","Akselere pou w pase l pi vit posib","Ralanti epi, si l san danje, deplase pou kite yon vwa vid bò kote l","Lè w ap pwoche yon veyikil ijans, otowout oswa remòkaj ki kanpe ak limyè k ap limen etèn, ralanti a yon vitès san danje epi pran yon vwa ki pa kole ak li. Si w pa ka deplase, ou toujou dwe ralanti."],["On a four-lane highway, a police car is stopped on the shoulder with its lights flashing. What does the move-over law require?","Nothing, as long as you stay in your lane and keep your speed","Stop behind the police car until it leaves","Speed up so you pass it as quickly as possible","Slow down and, if safe, move over to leave an empty lane beside it","Approaching a stopped emergency, highway or recovery vehicle with flashing lights, slow to a safe speed and move to a lane not next to it. If you cannot move over, you must still slow down."]],["pm729",2,["parking on a hill","pake sou mòn"],["Ou pake fas desann bò yon twotwa. Ki bò ou dwe vire wou devan yo?","Tou dwat","Nan direksyon opoze twotwa a","Nan direksyon twotwa a","Sa pa enpòtan si fren pakin nan mete","Desann bò yon twotwa: wou yo vire nan direksyon twotwa a. Monte bò yon twotwa: wou yo vire nan direksyon opoze twotwa a, sou bò vwa a. San twotwa: wou yo vire sou bò wout la. Toujou mete fren pakin nan."],["You park facing downhill next to a curb. Which way should you turn your front wheels?","Straight ahead","Away from the curb","Toward the curb","It does not matter with the parking brake on","Downhill against a curb: wheels toward the curb. Uphill against a curb: wheels away from the curb, toward the travel lane. No curb: wheels toward the edge of the road. Always set the parking brake."]],["pm730",0,["fire hydrant","bouch ponpye"],["Ki distans ou ka pake bò yon bouch ponpye?","Pa pi pre pase 10 pye","Pa pi pre pase 3 pye","Kole ak li, si w rete nan machin nan","Pa pi pre pase 50 pye","Ou pa ka pake nan 10 pye yon bouch ponpye oswa yon vwa ponpye, ni nan 20 pye yon kafou."],["How close to a fire hydrant may you park?","No closer than 10 feet","No closer than 3 feet","Right next to it, if you stay in the car","No closer than 50 feet","You may not park within 10 feet of a fire hydrant or fire lane, or within 20 feet of an intersection."]],["pm731",3,["intersection","kafou"],["Ki distans ou ka pake bò yon kafou?","5 pye","10 pye","Nenpòt kote andeyò pasaj pyeton an","Pa pi pre pase 20 pye","Pa pake nan 20 pye yon kafou, nan yon pasaj pyeton, ni devan yon antre kay."],["How close to an intersection may you park?","5 feet","10 feet","Anywhere outside the crosswalk","No closer than 20 feet","Do not park within 20 feet of an intersection, in a crosswalk, or in front of a driveway."]],["pm732",1,["parking brake","fren pakin"],["Ou kite machin ou pake nan ri a. Kisa lwa leta a mande?","Fèmen pòt yo a kle epi pran kle w sèlman","Etenn motè a, mete fren pakin nan, bloke kontak la, retire kle a epi fèmen pòt la a kle","Ou ka kite motè a ap mache si w ap tounen nan kèk minit","Limen limyè ijans yo","Lè w kite machin ou, lwa leta a mande pou w etenn motè a, mete fren pakin nan, bloke kontak la, retire kle a epi fèmen pòt la a kle."],["You leave your car parked on the street. What does state law require?","Only lock the doors and take your key","Stop the motor, set the parking brake, lock the ignition, remove the key and lock the door","You may leave the engine running if you will be back in a few minutes","Turn on the emergency flashers","When you leave your vehicle, state law requires you to stop the motor, set the parking brake, lock the ignition, remove the key and lock the door."]]],"8":[["pm801",2,["following distance","distans dèyè"],["A ki distans ou ka swiv yon kamyon ponpye k ap reponn yon alam?","100 pye","Nenpòt distans, si limyè w limen","Pa pi pre pase 300 pye","50 pye","Li ilegal pou w swiv pi pre pase 300 pye dèyè yon veyikil ijans k ap reponn yon alam. Rete omwen 800 pye lwen yon dife tou."],["How close may you follow a fire truck answering an alarm?","100 feet","Any distance, if your lights are on","No closer than 300 feet","50 feet","It is illegal to follow closer than 300 feet behind an emergency vehicle responding to an alarm. Also stay at least 800 feet from a fire."]],["pm802",1,["intersection","kafou"],["Ou nan mitan yon kafou lè w tande yon siren dèyè w. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Kanpe kote w ye a","Travèse kafou a, apre sa rale sou bò dwat epi kanpe","Fè bak pou sòti nan kafou a pou libere wout la","Rale sou bò goch","Pa janm kanpe nan mitan yon kafou. Travèse l, apre sa rale sou bò dwat depi l san danje. Pa rale agoch ni fren sanzatann."],["You are in the middle of an intersection when you hear a siren behind you. What should you do?","Stop right where you are","Drive through the intersection, then pull to the right and stop","Back up out of the intersection to clear the way","Pull to the left","Never stop in the middle of an intersection. Drive through it, then pull over to the right as soon as it is safe. Do not pull left or slam on the brakes."]],["pm803",3,["traffic stop","lè lapolis kanpe w"],["Yon polisye fè w rale sou kote epi l ap mache vin bò machin ou. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Desann epi mache al jwenn machin lapolis la","Chèche papye w yo anba chèz la","Rele yon moun nan telefòn ou","Rete nan machin nan ak men w kote yo ka wè yo","Rete nan veyikil la, kenbe men w vizib, etenn motè a, epi tann polisye a mande anvan w chèche lisans ak anrejistreman w. Pa sèvi ak telefòn ou."],["A police officer has pulled you over and is walking to your car. What should you do?","Get out and walk to the police car","Reach under the seat for your papers","Call someone on your phone","Stay in the car with your hands in plain sight","Stay in the vehicle, keep your hands visible, turn off the engine, and wait until the officer asks before reaching for your license and registration. Do not use your phone."]],["pm804",0,["skid","derapaj"],["Machin ou kòmanse derape sou yon wout ki glise. Kisa pye w dwe fè an premye?","Lage gaz la dousman epi pa fren","Fren fò","Peze gaz la pou machin nan kenbe wout la","Kenbe tou de pye w atè","Lè w ap derape, lage gaz la dousman epi pa sèvi ak fren, apre sa vire nan direksyon dèyè machin nan ap glise a. Ou ka bezwen vire de bò kèk fwa."],["Your car starts to skid on a slippery road. What should your feet do first?","Ease off the gas and do not brake","Brake hard","Press the gas to regain grip","Keep both feet on the floor","In a skid, ease off the gas and do not use the brakes, then steer in the direction the rear of the car is sliding. You may need to steer back and forth a few times."]],["pm805",3,["shoulder","bò wout"],["Wou dwat ou yo soti sou asfalt la epi tonbe sou bò wout la. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Vire volan an sou kou agoch touswit pou w remonte","Fren fò","Akselere pou kawotchou yo ka remonte sou asfalt la","Kenbe volan an fèm, lage gaz la, fren dousman, apre sa dirije tou dousman retounen","Kenbe volan an fèm, retire pye w sou gaz la dousman, fren dousman pou ralanti, gade machin ki dèyè w, apre sa dirije tou dousman retounen sou wout la."],["Your right wheels drift off the pavement onto the shoulder. What should you do?","Jerk the wheel back to the left right away to get back on","Brake hard","Speed up so the tires can climb back onto the pavement","Hold the wheel firmly, ease off the gas, brake gently, then steer gently back","Hold the steering wheel tightly, slowly take your foot off the gas, brake gently to reduce speed, check traffic behind you, then steer gently back onto the road."]],["pm806",2,["brake failure","fren ki pa mache"],["Machin ou PA gen fren antiblokaj, epi fren yo pa reponn toudenkou. Kisa ou dwe eseye an premye?","Etenn motè a","Mete l nan pak","Ponpe pedal fren an plizyè fwa vit","Louvri pòt la epi trennen pye w","San fren antiblokaj, ponpe pedal la vit pou fè presyon. Pa janm ponpe fren antiblokaj. Si sa pa mache, desann vitès epi mete fren pakin nan dousman, epi sèvi ak klaksòn ak limyè pou avèti lòt moun."],["Your car does NOT have antilock brakes, and the brakes suddenly do not respond. What should you try first?","Turn off the engine","Shift into park","Pump the brake pedal several times quickly","Open the door and drag your foot","Without antilock brakes, pump the pedal quickly to build pressure. Never pump antilock brakes. If that fails, downshift and apply the parking brake gently, and use horn and lights to warn others."]],["pm807",0,["stuck gas pedal","pedal gaz ki kole"],["Pedal gaz ou kole anba. Kisa ou dwe fè an premye?","Mete machin nan nan net epi peze fren an","Etenn kle a nèt pandan machin nan ap mache","Ponpe pedal gaz la","Bese pou w libere l ak men w","Mete machin nan nan net epi fren pou ralanti. Eseye libere pedal la ak pye w, kenbe je w sou wout la, epi soti sou kote epi kanpe lè l san danje."],["Your gas pedal sticks down. What should you do first?","Shift into neutral and press the brake","Turn the key all the way off while moving","Pump the gas pedal","Reach down with your hand to free it","Put the car in neutral and brake to slow down. Try to free the pedal with your foot, keep your eyes on the road, and pull off and stop when it is safe."]],["pm808",1,["head-on","fas a fas"],["Yon machin ap vin dirèkteman sou ou nan vwa w. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Vire sou kou nan liy goch la","Ralanti, rale adwat epi klaksonnen","Akselere pou w pase machin nan anvan l rive sou ou","Kanpe nan liy ou epi tann","Si yon veyikil ap vin fas a fas sou ou nan vwa w, ralanti, rale adwat, epi klaksonnen pou avèti lòt chofè a."],["A car is coming straight at you in your lane. What should you do?","Swerve into the left lane","Slow down, pull to the right and sound your horn","Speed up to get past the car before it reaches you","Stop in your lane and wait","If a vehicle comes toward you head on in your lane, slow down, pull to the right, and sound your horn to alert the other driver."]],["pm809",3,["railroad tracks","ray tren"],["Machin ou kanpe sou ray tren epi gen yon tren k ap vini. Kisa ou fè?","Kontinye eseye estat motè a jiskaske tren an tou pre","Rete nan machin nan ak senti tout moun tache","Fè tout moun desann, apre sa nou tout pouse machin nan sot sou ray yo","Fè tout moun desann epi kouri kite ray yo nan direksyon tren an, an dyagonal","Fè tout moun desann touswit. Kouri lwen ray yo nan yon ang 45 degre nan direksyon tren an ap soti a, pou evite debri k ap vole, apre sa rele 911."],["Your car stalls on railroad tracks and a train is coming. What do you do?","Keep trying to start the engine until the train is very close","Stay in the car with everyone's seat belts fastened","Have everyone get out, then push the car off the tracks together","Get everyone out and run from the tracks toward the train, at an angle","Get everyone out immediately. Run away from the tracks at a 45-degree angle in the direction the train is coming from, to avoid flying wreckage, then call 911."]],["pm810",2,["vehicle in water","machin nan dlo"],["Machin ou tonbe nan yon dlo fon. Kijan ou dwe soti?","Louvri pòt la touswit","Tann machin nan plen dlo","Demare senti w epi soti pa yon fenèt","Monte sou do machin nan pa twou do a sèlman","Demare senti w epi soti pa yon fenèt; louvri fenèt elektrik yo vit anvan yo sispann mache. Pa louvri yon pòt: dlo ap antre fò epi machin nan ka vire."],["Your car goes into deep water. How should you get out?","Open the door right away","Wait for the car to fill with water","Unfasten your belt and escape through a window","Climb onto the roof through the sunroof only","Unfasten your seat belt and escape through a window; open power windows quickly before they stop working. Do not open a door: water rushes in and the car can flip."]],["pm811",0,["warning triangle","triyang avètisman"],["Machin ou tonbe an pàn sou yon otowout divize. Ki kote ou mete triyang avètisman yo?","10 pye ak 100 pye dèyè veyikil la","Sèlman devan veyikil la","Sou kapo a","500 pye devan","Sou yon otowout divize, mete triyang oswa limyè avètisman 10 pye ak 100 pye dèyè veyikil ou. Sou yon wout de sans oswa ki pa divize, ajoute youn 100 pye devan."],["You break down on a divided highway. Where do you place your warning triangles?","10 feet and 100 feet behind the vehicle","Only in front of the vehicle","On the hood","500 feet ahead","On a divided highway, place triangles or flares 10 feet and 100 feet behind your vehicle. On a two-way or undivided road, add one 100 feet in front."]],["pm812",1,["crash report","rapò aksidan"],["Ou nan yon aksidan ki fè $1,500 domaj san blese. Kisa ou dwe ranpli, e kilè?","Anyen, paske pèsonn pa blese","Yon rapò aksidan pou RMV ak lapolis lokal nan senk jou","Sèlman yon apèl bay konpayi asirans ou","Yon rapò ak konpayi asirans ou nan 30 jou","Nenpòt aksidan ki gen blese, lanmò oswa $1,000 oswa plis domaj dwe rapòte bay RMV ak lapolis lokal nan senk jou. Di asirans ou sèlman pa ase."],["You are in a crash that causes $1,500 of damage and no injuries. What must you file, and when?","Nothing, since no one was hurt","A crash report with the RMV and local police within five days","Only a call to your insurance company","A report with your insurance company within 30 days","Any crash with injury, death or $1,000 or more in property damage must be reported to the RMV and local police within five days. Telling your insurer is not enough."]],["pm813",3,["Driver Removal Law","Lwa sou Retire Machin"],["Ou fè yon ti aksidan epi pèsonn pa blese. Kisa Lwa sou Retire Machin nan mande?","Kite machin yo egzakteman kote yo ye pou lapolis","Kondui ale lakay epi rapòte l pita","Rele yon remòkaj anvan w deplase","Retire machin yo nan vwa sikilasyon yo pou mete yo yon kote ki san danje","Si pa gen blese, Lwa sou Retire Machin nan mande pou w retire machin yo nan vwa sikilasyon yo pou mete yo yon kote ki san danje. Apre sa bay youn lòt enfòmasyon. Pa janm kite sèn nan."],["You have a minor crash and no one is hurt. What does the Driver Removal Law require?","Leave the cars exactly where they are for police","Drive home and report it later","Call a tow truck before moving","Move the vehicles out of the travel lanes to a safe place","If there are no injuries, the Driver Removal Law requires moving the vehicles out of travel lanes to a safe place. Then exchange information. Never leave the scene."]],["pm814",2,["downed wires","fil kouran ki tonbe"],["Apre yon aksidan, fil kouran tonbe sou yon machin ki gen moun andedan. Kisa yo dwe fè?","Sote soti touswit","Eseye deplase fil yo ak yon bwa","Rete andedan jiskaske moun ijans yo rive","Kondui machin nan soti anba fil yo","Pa pwoche fil ki tonbe yo. Si fil yo sou yon veyikil, moun ki andedan yo dwe rete jiskaske moun ijans yo rive, epi pèsonn pa dwe touche veyikil la."],["After a crash, power lines have fallen on a car with people inside. What should they do?","Jump out right away","Try to move the wires with a stick","Stay inside until emergency personnel arrive","Drive the car out from under the wires","Do not go near fallen wires. If wires are on a vehicle, the people inside should stay there until emergency personnel arrive, and no one should touch the vehicle."]],["pm815",0,["hit and run","frape epi kouri"],["Ou grate yon machin ki pake epi pa gen pèsonn bò la. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Eseye jwenn pwopriyetè a, oswa avèti lapolis lokal","Ale, paske pèsonn pa wè sa","Kite yon nòt sou vit devan an, san non w","Tann 10 minit, apre sa ale","Si w fè domaj sou yon veyikil ki pake oswa yon pwopriyete, eseye jwenn pwopriyetè a oswa avèti lapolis lokal. Kite sèn nan san w pa idantifye tèt ou se yon vyolasyon kriminèl «frape epi kouri»."],["You scrape a parked car and no one is around. What must you do?","Try to find the owner, or notify the local police","Leave, since no one saw it happen","Leave a note on the windshield, without your name","Wait 10 minutes, then leave","If you damage a parked vehicle or property, try to locate the owner or notify the local police. Leaving the scene without identifying yourself is a criminal hit-and-run violation."]],["pm816",1,["injured person","moun ki blese"],["Ou kanpe pou ede nan yon aksidan. Yon moun ap senyen epi l konsyan. Kisa ou dwe fè?","Pote l nan machin ou touswit","Peze dirèkteman sou blesi a epi kenbe l trankil ak cho","Ba l yon bagay pou l bwè","Ale lè lapolis rive san w pa bay non w","Pa deplase yon moun ki blese sof si sa nesesè. Peze dirèkteman sou kote k ap senyen an jiskaske èd rive, epi kouvri l pou l rete cho e pou evite chòk."],["You stop to help at a crash. A person is bleeding and conscious. What should you do?","Move them to your car right away","Press directly on the wound and keep them still and warm","Give them something to drink","Leave once police arrive without giving your name","Do not move an injured person unless necessary. Put pressure directly on bleeding until help arrives, and cover them to keep warm and prevent shock."]]]};
